
1
00:00:41,149 --> 00:00:42,149
-- ==CMCT团队荣誉出品==--
字幕调校: 虚无    影片压制: 罗哥
招募Q号: 76846146

2
00:00:42,184 --> 00:00:45,150
片名: 生死狙击

3
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,630
有动静
Movement.

4
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,990
有两人
Two men.

5
00:02:08,470 --> 00:02:10,040
大约还有…
Approximately

6
00:02:12,410 --> 00:02:14,270
四十只羊
40 goats.

7
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:18,110
它们不是敌人 没必要射杀
They're not on anybody's side. We don't have to shoot them.

8
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:20,210
撤退方向?
Egress?

9
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:25,780
首选空中撤离 其次是公路 再次是水路
Primary over the top, secondary down the road, tertiary to the river.

10
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:30,280
在河里没人能追踪你 除了鱼儿
No one can track you through the water except a fish.

11
00:02:40,070 --> 00:02:43,140
莎拉下个月就进护士学校
Sarah's headed off to nursing school next month.

12
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:45,700
她自己努力的成果
She sewed that herself.

13
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:47,170
她很漂亮
It's beautiful.

14
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:51,610
你肯定这是个维和任务吗?
You sure this is a peacekeeping mission?

15
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:55,110
通常不会一开始就这么和平
Normally there isn't any peace to start with.

16
00:02:56,950 --> 00:02:59,110
现在周围寂静得吓人
This shit's awful calm.

17
00:03:07,450 --> 00:03:10,900
埃塞俄比亚 美军雷门尼尔营地 海军基地之一 是美国在非洲之角的重要战略基地

18
00:03:11,530 --> 00:03:12,790
- 不是这个坐标 - 是 长官
- Not at these coordinates. - Yes, sir.

19
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,060
继续制订后备计划
Go ahead and plot an alternate.

20
00:03:14,070 --> 00:03:15,360
是 长官
Yes, sir.

21
00:03:15,570 --> 00:03:18,800
指挥所 这里是 TS-129 完毕
Command Post, Command Post, this is TS-129, over.

22
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:22,540
长官 我已经观察到 TS-129 当前位置
Sir, I have visual confirmation of TS-129's current position.

23
00:03:22,550 --> 00:03:26,140
任务完成 正前往撤离点 还有八公里
Mission accomplished, en route to extract site. Distance eight klicks. Over.

24
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:28,115
指挥所 毒蛇呼叫
Command Post, Command Post, this is Viper.

25
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:30,580
发现友军正往撤离点行动
I have friendly forces moving towards extraction point, over.

26
00:03:32,050 --> 00:03:34,120
注意了 我们的人正在过来
Heads up, our boys are coming through.

27
00:03:34,155 --> 00:03:36,050
毒蛇注意 这里是指挥所
Viper, this is CP. Be advised,

28
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:39,530
有可疑武装分子 从正面向 TS-129 进攻
possible hostile forces approaching TS-129 at their 12:00.

29
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,820
结束对话
Call them out.

30
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,260
目标
Target.

31
00:03:42,970 --> 00:03:44,760
B 区纵深地带
Sector Bravo, deep.

32
00:03:44,770 --> 00:03:47,130
卡车一辆 载有重机枪
Vehicle, belt-fed weapon.

33
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,200
距离?
Range it.

34
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,500
距离八百七十码 正在接近
870 yards and closing.

35
00:03:55,340 --> 00:03:57,910
风向 偏右 3/4 修正 2 分
Wind, three-quarter value, push 2 left.

36
00:03:58,810 --> 00:04:02,110
公路九百码处有一开阔地带
900 yards. Wide spot on the road.

37
00:04:03,550 --> 00:04:04,920
目标锁定
On target.

38
00:04:04,955 --> 00:04:06,255
随时待命
Hold scope.

39
00:04:06,290 --> 00:04:07,720
可以射击了
Fire when ready.

40
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:12,350
命中
Hit.

41
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:21,190
指挥所 毒蛇呼叫 威胁已解除 完毕
Command Post, this is Viper. Hostile threat down, over.

42
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:24,700
毒蛇 这里是指挥所 收到报告 完毕
Viper, this is Command Post. We copy your traffic, over.

43
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:37,385
告诉他们 我们可以撤了
Call it in. It's time to go.

44
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,420
指挥所 毒蛇呼叫 任务完成
Command Post, this is Viper. Mission accomplished.

45
00:04:39,455 --> 00:04:40,550
- 准备撤离 - 见鬼!
- Packing up. - Shit!

46
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:44,020
毒蛇请注意 大批 武装分子正在 B 区接近你
Viper, be advised larger hostile forces approaching near sector Bravo.

47
00:04:44,030 --> 00:04:46,460
怎么让敌人靠得这么近
Werert supposed to be hostiles that close!

48
00:04:53,470 --> 00:04:57,870
古奇树 六百七十五码 时速三十英里 提前量三密耳
Crooked tree. 675, 30 miles an hour, three-mil lead.

49
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:06,910
那个机枪射手 九百码 偏右 3/4
Position to machine gun. 900, three-quarter value.

50
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,350
好了就打
Fire when ready.

51
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:16,450
敌方头目 九百二十码 偏右 3/4
Jefe. 920. Three-quarter value.

52
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:19,650
- 我见到了 唐尼 - 可以打了
- I see it, Donnie. I see it. - Fire when ready.

53
00:05:28,370 --> 00:05:30,840
- 他们不知道我们位置 - 但最怕误打误中
- They don't know where we are. - But they might get lucky!

54
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:35,300
指挥所 毒蛇呼叫
Command Post, Command Post, this is Viper.

55
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:37,645
我们已将敌人拦截
Enemy forces have been stopped. Break.

56
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:40,510
我方人员继续向撤离地点前进
Friendlies are continuing on to extract point. Break.

57
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:44,520
我们受到敌方小型 武器和迫击炮攻击
We're receiving small arms and indirect fire from hostile troops. Break.

58
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,690
指挥所 听到没有?
Command Post, do you read me?

59
00:05:48,725 --> 00:05:50,020
关闭仪器
Shut it down.

60
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:51,225
他们两个训练有素
They're highly-trained men,

61
00:05:51,260 --> 00:05:54,120
在那一地区作战违反国际法
eight kilometers inside a country we are not supposed to be in.

62
00:05:54,130 --> 00:05:56,560
他们自己完全有能力撤退 停止一切联络
I'm sure they'll get out just fine. Shut it down now.

63
00:05:56,570 --> 00:05:58,095
检查通讯 有没有收到?
Radio check. Do you read me?

64
00:05:58,130 --> 00:06:00,290
收拾东西 我们走 有没有收到?
- Okay, wrap it up. Let's go! - Do you read me?

65
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:03,070
把录音拿出来 把录音拿出来收拾好
- Pull out those tracks. - Pull out those tracks and pack it up!

66
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:17,040
情报说他们没有空中支援啊
Intelligence said they didn't have air support!

67
00:06:17,050 --> 00:06:18,280
马上报告
Call it in!

68
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:24,430
见鬼!频段关闭了
Shit! The channel's down!

69
00:06:24,465 --> 00:06:25,550
不可能
That's impossible!

70
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,025
通讯失效了
The comm link's dead!

71
00:06:27,060 --> 00:06:30,000
我们被放弃了 没关系 我们自己会回去
They left us here. Don't worry, we're getting home!

72
00:07:11,570 --> 00:07:12,830
唐尼?
Donnie?

73
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:16,670
唐尼
Donnie!

74
00:08:18,170 --> 00:08:20,860
三十六个月后

75
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,730
过来 小子
Come on, boy!

76
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:49,770
过来 山姆!
Come on, Sam!

77
00:08:51,470 --> 00:08:53,700
干什么?
What're you doing, huh? What're you doing?

78
00:08:53,710 --> 00:08:54,830
过来
Come on.

79
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,040
我没吃的了
What? I got nothing.

80
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:57,210
干什么?
What?

81
00:08:58,210 --> 00:09:00,410
我们走 走吧
All right, come on, let's go. Let's go.

82
00:09:02,650 --> 00:09:04,150
好孩子 进去
That's a good boy.

83
00:09:17,230 --> 00:09:18,820
好孩子
Good boy.

84
00:09:24,470 --> 00:09:27,440
看看他们又会推销些 什么骗人东西
Well, let's see what lies they're trying to sell us today.

85
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,400
过来
Here, boy.

86
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:35,040
好孩子
Good boy.

87
00:09:37,100 --> 00:09:38,560
弗吉尼亚州 兰利

88
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:49,090
枪炮中士鲍·李·史瓦格
Gunnery Sergeant Bob Lee Swagger.

89
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:51,690
海军陆战退役队员
USMC, retired.

90
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:54,160
他是最佳人选
He is the best there is.

91
00:09:54,170 --> 00:09:56,860
他最后一次执行任务时发生意外
His last assignment went wrong.

92
00:09:56,870 --> 00:10:00,270
他成了情报机构执行任务的牺牲品
Put in unfriendly territory on a loan-out and left as expendable.

93
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:03,810
敌人出动了攻击直升机和 一个连的兵力向他们攻击
Opposing force sent an attack helicopter and a hundred-man company.

94
00:10:03,845 --> 00:10:06,750
他的好友兼目标观察员阵亡
His best friend and spotter was killed.

95
00:10:06,785 --> 00:10:08,110
没有正式报告
No official report.

96
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:12,450
秘密报告称 他消灭了 70％的敌人 其余逃走
Ghost report says he inflicted 70 percent casualties, the rest fled.

97
00:10:12,485 --> 00:10:14,650
将他丢弃在那的情报部门长官
The agency asset that left them there to die?

98
00:10:14,660 --> 00:10:17,920
两周后消失得无影无踪
Suddenly removed from the face of the earth two weeks after.

99
00:10:17,930 --> 00:10:19,930
但没有人起诉鲍·李
They never laid it at Bob Lee's feet.

100
00:10:19,965 --> 00:10:21,790
他一周以后退役
He retired a week later.

101
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:24,990
我想他自己不甘心做牺牲品
I guess Bob Lee didn't think he was expendable.

102
00:10:35,810 --> 00:10:37,440
他自己种地和打猎为生?
Grows and shoots his own food.

103
00:10:37,450 --> 00:10:39,740
是的 他很少离开山里
Yeah, he rarely ventures out at all.

104
00:10:39,750 --> 00:10:43,980
他是一个有责任感的爱国主义者
This is a man with a history of duty and patriotism.

105
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:47,780
- 爱国主义是他始终如一的信仰 - 明白
- Not as punch lines, but as core beliefs. - Aye.

106
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:51,290
有些人一旦信仰破灭就会无所适从
Some people don't know what to do when their belief system collapses.

107
00:10:51,890 --> 00:10:53,720
鲍·李就是那类人
Bob Lee is one of those.

108
00:11:03,770 --> 00:11:05,100
你确定有人吗?
You sure, boy?

109
00:11:18,290 --> 00:11:21,880
不 我不需要买任何东西
Nope. I ain't buying. I don't want any.

110
00:11:21,890 --> 00:11:25,690
从哪来回哪去
You guys turn around and go back to wherever you came from.

111
00:11:26,460 --> 00:11:28,925
鲍·李·史瓦格?
Bob Lee Swagger?

112
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,090
我是艾萨克·约翰逊上校
My name is Colonel Isaac Johnson.

113
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,760
你可够难找的
You're a hard man to find.

114
00:11:32,770 --> 00:11:34,130
难度还不够
But not hard enough.

115
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:35,760
我们从很远的地方来
Come a long way to see you.

116
00:11:36,010 --> 00:11:37,870
有件事想和你谈谈
We have some business needs your attention.

117
00:11:37,905 --> 00:11:39,730
下山时要打一档
You wanna use your low gear going down the road

118
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:40,930
不然刹车会失灵
or your brakes'll go.

119
00:11:40,940 --> 00:11:43,910
- 过来 乖狗 - 小心点
- Come here. Come here, boy. - Don't do that.

120
00:11:45,010 --> 00:11:48,410
没有我的邀请你过不去 除非打死他
Come near the porch I didn't invite you, you'd have to shoot the dog.

121
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:51,010
你的速度不行
That's a slow draw you got there.

122
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:52,550
你想找死吗?
Sure you want to do that?

123
00:11:52,890 --> 00:11:54,480
在这谁想杀死我的狗
Shoot a dog in this county on a mars land,

124
00:11:54,490 --> 00:11:56,920
我就把他埋到山里 就算一两个月后告诉治安官
I'd bury you in the hill, and tell the sheriff a month or two later.

125
00:11:56,930 --> 00:11:58,150
他也能理解
He understands.

126
00:11:59,530 --> 00:12:01,190
把你的手从枪上拿开
Take your hand off your weapon.

127
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,420
慢慢来
Slowly.

128
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:05,670
别让枪炮中士真的把你埋在山里
So the gunnery sergeant doesn't have to bury you in the hill.

129
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,630
我没带枪
I don't carry a gun.

130
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:15,109
知道这是什么吗?
You know what that is?

131
00:12:15,110 --> 00:12:17,140
国会荣誉勋章 美国政府颁发的最高军事荣衔
It's a Congressional Medal of Honor.

132
00:12:17,650 --> 00:12:19,270
很少人能够得到它
They don't hand those out easy.

133
00:12:19,350 --> 00:12:20,420
是你的?
Yours?

134
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:22,085
是的
Yeah.

135
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:24,210
你父亲也得到过 对吗?
Your father had one, didn't he?

136
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,840
你怎么得到的?
What did you do?

137
00:12:25,850 --> 00:12:29,690
全靠玩命 我救了另一个战友的性命
Something foolhardy. Kept some other boys alive.

138
00:12:29,725 --> 00:12:31,560
给我五分钟好吗?
Will you give me five minutes?

139
00:12:33,930 --> 00:12:35,760
让你的走狗在外面等
Yeah, your dog stays outside.

140
00:12:36,870 --> 00:12:38,590
过来 孩子 进去
Come on, boy. Get in there.

141
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:44,230
我需要你制订一个刺杀总统的计划
I need you to plan a presidential assassination.

142
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,360
哪国总统?
Whose president?

143
00:12:45,370 --> 00:12:46,500
我国总统
Ours.

144
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,510
不是真的刺杀
I didn't say "execute".

145
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:51,250
只是计划
Plan.

146
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:54,110
为的是阻止真的计划发生
So it can be stopped.

147
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:57,850
情报部门说有人计划 在两周内刺杀总统
There's gonna be an attempt on the life of the President in the next two weeks.

148
00:12:57,885 --> 00:13:01,290
我们破译了一段匿名密码
Code was broken on an anonymous transmission.

149
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:04,925
出自政府内部
It was internal.

150
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:07,660
所以不能让政府部门参与破案
We can't go to the usual agencies.

151
00:13:07,695 --> 00:13:10,360
敌人已经打入内部
The government itself has been penetrated.

152
00:13:10,370 --> 00:13:15,930
这段时间 总统 要参加3项公开活动
The President has three public engagements during that time.

153
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:20,530
分别在巴尔的摩费城 和华盛顿特区
Baltimore, Philadelphia, Washington, D.C.

154
00:13:20,540 --> 00:13:23,480
特工署的标准警戒线…
Standard Secret Service protective cordon

155
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:26,410
通常设在八百八十码之外
is out to 880 yards.

156
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:31,180
但截获的情报称 这次 袭击地点会定在1英里之外
But this intercept claims that the shot will be taken from beyond a mile.

157
00:13:31,190 --> 00:13:34,280
你去实地勘查一下 然后告诉我们你的做法
We need you to scout, tell us how you would do it,

158
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:36,150
我们就会阻止他
so we could stop it.

159
00:13:37,030 --> 00:13:41,650
不过老实说 我不大相信 这样的袭击会得逞
I'm not entirely convinced that a shot like this could be made.

160
00:13:42,870 --> 00:13:45,160
但不能掉以轻心
But let's not take the chance.

161
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:48,450
你的远距离射击能力到底怎样?
Your longer shots were never confirmed.

162
00:13:48,485 --> 00:13:50,600
远距离射击通常发生在…
That's because long shots generally go places

163
00:13:50,610 --> 00:13:53,540
你们不愿意去确认的场合
you wouldn't wanna have to go afterwards to confirm them.

164
00:13:53,575 --> 00:13:56,240
确认只是做表面文章而已
Confirmatiors a desk pogue's problem.

165
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:59,340
知道远距离射击要考虑什么吗?
You know what it takes to make a shot at that range?

166
00:13:59,350 --> 00:14:00,970
需要考虑所有相关的因素:
Everything comes into play that far.

167
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:04,180
湿度温度高度 风向扬尘…
Humidity, elevation, temperature, wind, spindrift.

168
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:05,585
子弹飞向目标需要六到十秒时间
There's a 6-to10-second flight time

169
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:07,679
所以必须估算提前量
so you have to shoot at where the target's going to be.

170
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:10,870
甚至科里奥利作用和地球自转都得考虑
Even the Coriolis effect, the spin of the Earth, comes into play.

171
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:13,360
总统会穿防弹衣 所以要射击头部
President'll be wearing body amour. That means a headshot,

172
00:14:13,395 --> 00:14:14,620
还要在一英里之外
at over a mile.

173
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:16,990
你相信真有这么大本事的枪手吗?
You believe there's a shooter involved capable of making this shot?

174
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,295
我相信
Yes.

175
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:20,800
那麻烦可就大了 你们一定要找到枪手
Well, then you got a real problem. You need to find the shooter.

176
00:14:20,835 --> 00:14:23,270
那是另一批人的任务
That's being worked on from another direction.

177
00:14:23,370 --> 00:14:25,130
我们需要你干这事
We need you to do this.

178
00:14:25,140 --> 00:14:27,175
我根本不喜欢现任总统
Don't really like the President much.

179
00:14:27,210 --> 00:14:29,210
前任总统更不喜欢
Didrt like the one before that much, either.

180
00:14:29,245 --> 00:14:31,180
但是你喜欢总统制吗?
You like the idea of the President?

181
00:14:31,450 --> 00:14:33,010
喜欢自由的国家吗?
Living in a free country?

182
00:14:33,020 --> 00:14:35,550
难道我们能容忍让坏人统治吗…
Do we allow America to be ruled by thugs?

183
00:14:35,585 --> 00:14:37,410
没关系 几年而已
Sure, some years we do.

184
00:14:38,550 --> 00:14:41,520
我相信你曾站在国旗前…
I believe you stood before a flag

185
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,290
庄严宣誓过…
and solemnly swore

186
00:14:44,090 --> 00:14:48,060
要支持和捍卫美国宪法…
that you'd support and defend the Constitution of the United States

187
00:14:48,095 --> 00:14:49,820
抗击一切敌人
against all enemies,

188
00:14:49,830 --> 00:14:51,560
无论来自国内外
foreign and domestic.

189
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:53,600
五分钟到了
I think your five minutes is up.

190
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:04,600
听着 孩子
Listen to me, son.

191
00:15:06,580 --> 00:15:08,810
我不希望你下星期打开电视
I don't want you to turn on the TV next week

192
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:12,285
看到总统身亡时…
and see the President dead,

193
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:15,080
后悔自己不阻止这一切
and know you could've done something about it.

194
00:15:15,820 --> 00:15:17,950
希望你好自为之
Don't do that to yourself.

195
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:40,540
这是新型号吗?
Is that the new one?

196
00:15:40,550 --> 00:15:41,910
那辆车
The truck.

197
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,855
装有大马力发动机?
You got the big engine in there?

198
00:15:44,890 --> 00:15:48,550
我看看 八升 V-8 发动机
Wow, look at that, huh? Eight-liter V8.

199
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:52,350
厉害 环保署竟然 不管你的每公里油耗
Thing's so big, EPA doesn't even bother to give you the gas mileage for it.

200
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,020
我能拍张照吗?
You mind if I take a picture?

201
00:15:55,730 --> 00:15:57,360
真漂亮
This is beautiful.

202
00:16:01,770 --> 00:16:04,600
这电话二十四小时都有人接听
Someone will be at this number night or day.

203
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:12,410
看到他刚才做什么了吗? 他才不是在拍发动机
You see what he did? He didn't need a photo of the engine.

204
00:16:12,445 --> 00:16:14,810
他醉翁之意不在酒
No, he doesn't give a rat's ass about the engine.

205
00:16:14,820 --> 00:16:16,440
他受过反侦察训练
He's trained in counterintel.

206
00:16:16,450 --> 00:16:18,880
他的距离足以把车牌照下来
Backed up far enough to take a picture of the plates.

207
00:16:18,890 --> 00:16:20,480
我们就需要这种人
This is our guy.

208
00:16:20,490 --> 00:16:21,955
他好像拒绝你了
I thought he turned you down.

209
00:16:21,990 --> 00:16:24,520
他答应了 只是自己没有意识到
He said yes. He just doesn't know it yet.

210
00:17:39,230 --> 00:17:41,460
一英里大概一千七百六十码
1,760's a mile.

211
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:45,930
真够远 你觉得总统会有事吗?
It's a far piece, Sam. Think the President ought to worry?

212
00:18:17,670 --> 00:18:19,360
看来总统凶多吉少
Yeah, I think he better worry.

213
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:35,850
它不会有事
Yeah, he'll be fine.

214
00:18:36,930 --> 00:18:40,980
每天喂它一次 孤独时给它念念弹道表就没事了
Just feed him once a day. Read him a few ballistics tables if he looks Ionely.

215
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,360
好 再见
Yep. I'm out.

216
00:18:44,070 --> 00:18:45,600
老朋友
Come here, buddy.

217
00:18:46,270 --> 00:18:47,530
好了
Okay.

218
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:51,690
我出几天门你不会寂寞吧?
Think you'll be able to tough it out without me for a couple days?

219
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:53,510
那好
Yeah.

220
00:19:11,950 --> 00:19:14,950
华盛顿特区

221
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:52,020
马里兰州 巴尔的摩

222
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:18,290
宾夕法尼亚州 费城

223
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:22,820
这里是指挥所 你们情况如何?
This is Command Post. What's your status? Over.

224
00:20:22,830 --> 00:20:24,760
我们完成了第六条街
Yeah, we're finishing up here on 6th.

225
00:20:24,770 --> 00:20:27,660
收到 请随时报告情况
Roger that. We copy. Checkpoint down, over.

226
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:45,420
各位面前的是独立宫 美利坚合众国的发源地
Before you stands Independence Hall, the birthplace of the United States

227
00:20:45,455 --> 00:20:48,420
是美国历史上的重要建筑之一
and one of the most important buildings in American history.

228
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,650
于一七三二年建成
Built in 1732...

229
00:20:50,660 --> 00:20:52,855
随时留意七十二号…
Keep a visual eye on 72nd...

230
00:20:52,890 --> 00:20:57,560
是独立宣言以及美国宪法的签署地
...both the Declaration of Independence and the U.S. Constitution were debated and signed here.

231
00:21:06,040 --> 00:21:07,130
三个城市中…
Out of the three cities,

232
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:10,180
只有一个最有可能实施暗杀
there's only one with a reasonably high chance of success.

233
00:21:10,750 --> 00:21:12,070
巴尔的摩没有足够空间
There was no room in Baltimore.

234
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:13,610
街道狭窄 修正风受影响
Street isn't wide enough to correct for the windage,

235
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:15,445
建筑物遮挡视线
buildings are in the way.

236
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,075
去华盛顿特区等于自杀
D.C.'s a pure suicide mission.

237
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:18,140
除非你确定刺客的兴趣在于……
I mean, unless you're sure your shooter's interested

238
00:21:18,150 --> 00:21:20,400
来生那70个处女
in 70 virgins waiting for him in the afterlife,

239
00:21:20,490 --> 00:21:22,110
否则免谈
I'd rule that out.

240
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:23,350
这次袭击只能在费城
Shot's got to be taken from Philly.

241
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,060
而且只能在一千八百码外进行
From beyond 1,800 yards, though.

242
00:21:26,095 --> 00:21:27,595
一共有六个可能位置
It's one of six possible locations,

243
00:21:27,630 --> 00:21:30,660
其中一个是位于总统上方五层楼
approximately five stories above the President's location.

244
00:21:31,170 --> 00:21:33,890
估计子弹会飞行五到六秒
Flight time of the bullet that distance is five to six seconds.

245
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:35,230
他们会等到总统站到讲台开始演讲
They'll have to wait till he takes the podium,

246
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,860
开始讲几句之后
several lines into his speech.

247
00:21:36,870 --> 00:21:39,770
那时他处于静止状态
That way he'd be completely static, obviously at his most exposed.

248
00:21:39,805 --> 00:21:41,775
而且会选用大口径武器
Shot requires a large-caliber weapon.

249
00:21:41,810 --> 00:21:44,670
很可能使用自制子弹 选用青铜合金
Expect the bullet to be handmade, bronzed alloy turned on a lathe.

250
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,080
弹道系数稍低一些
Slightly lower ballistics coefficient,

251
00:21:46,115 --> 00:21:47,210
弹身更光滑
touch more slippery.

252
00:21:47,220 --> 00:21:48,810
这就是我的做法
Least that's what I'd do.

253
00:21:48,820 --> 00:21:51,250
那么远你能保证打死他吗?
You can kill him from that far away?

254
00:21:53,150 --> 00:21:55,220
一英里半 子弹动能达到最大
Mile and a half, the bullet's going to strike with more energy

255
00:21:55,255 --> 00:21:56,520
比点四四 Magnum 手枪的威力还大
than a.44 Magnum point blank.

256
00:21:56,555 --> 00:21:58,320
不成问题
Yeah, I think you can kill him.

257
00:21:58,830 --> 00:22:00,190
麻烦的是风向
The challenge is the wind.

258
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:03,560
距离太远 一丝微风都会坏事
Lightest breeze uncorrected at that distance is enough to ruin the shot.

259
00:22:03,570 --> 00:22:06,860
他必须在讲台位置和 射击位置之间设立指示物
He's gonna need indicators between the podium and the shooting position.

260
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:08,460
速度校正比较容易
Velocity corrections are easy,

261
00:22:08,470 --> 00:22:10,370
但角度修正涉及到三角学问
but an angle change, that becomes a trig problem.

262
00:22:10,405 --> 00:22:12,405
他必须一瞬间完成心算
He's gotta do that in his head on the fly.

263
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:15,510
否则想一枪命中非常困难
Without something to gauge, your shot's just too tough to make cold bore.

264
00:22:15,545 --> 00:22:18,670
一份完美的报告 小子
Impressive recon and report, son.

265
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:20,810
如果下手过早 他有可能逃走
Move too soon, we lose him.

266
00:22:20,820 --> 00:22:22,210
我们想抓活的
We want to take him alive.

267
00:22:22,750 --> 00:22:25,840
不查出黑手 悲剧还会发生
If we don't know who hired him, it could just happen again.

268
00:22:27,060 --> 00:22:31,420
我们有六个三人小组随时待命
We'll have six three-man teams standing by.

269
00:22:32,460 --> 00:22:34,120
史瓦格军士?
Gunnery Sergeant Swagger?

270
00:22:34,130 --> 00:22:35,360
请留步
A moment?

271
00:22:37,430 --> 00:22:40,000
你为国家做了很大贡献
You've done your country a great service, son.

272
00:22:40,035 --> 00:22:41,090
到时候… 不 听着…
- On the day... - Look...

273
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:42,260
听我说
Listen.

274
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:46,670
你是少数了解内情的人之一
You're one of the few people who knows what to look for.

275
00:22:47,540 --> 00:22:49,510
我需要观察员
I could use a spotter.

276
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:58,275
谢谢 费城
Thank you, Philadelphia.

277
00:23:58,310 --> 00:24:00,510
总统二十分钟内发表演说
The President speaks in 20 minutes.

278
00:24:00,520 --> 00:24:02,240
…站在各位面前的讲台上…
...before you on this stage...

279
00:24:02,250 --> 00:24:05,010
通知火力小组各就位
Notify our teams. Check their positions.

280
00:24:05,020 --> 00:24:08,210
…当年爱国者们共聚 独立宫草拟了一份文件
...patriots met in Independence Hall and created a document,

281
00:24:08,220 --> 00:24:10,090
创立了《独立宣言》
the Declaration of Independence...

282
00:24:10,125 --> 00:24:11,320
长官
Sir?

283
00:24:11,330 --> 00:24:13,050
…和创立了美利坚合众国
...and a country, the United States of America,

284
00:24:13,060 --> 00:24:14,590
并改变了世界
that changed the world.

285
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:16,995
费城是我们的家园…
Philadelphia is our home. We are...

286
00:24:17,030 --> 00:24:18,895
各小组注意 这里是监听站
Stand by, all teams. This is Listening Post.

287
00:24:18,930 --> 00:24:21,800
闪光已进入 J 点
Flashlight's current location is approaching Checkpoint Jason.

288
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:25,400
各狙击小组报告情况
All sniper teams send update on your sitrep.

289
00:24:26,210 --> 00:24:28,900
待命 我们的视线很清楚
- Stand by. - Yes, I have a clear line of sight.

290
00:24:35,650 --> 00:24:37,270
收到
Copy that.

291
00:24:37,290 --> 00:24:39,715
十八号哨位 一切正常
Post 18 clear, over.

292
00:24:39,750 --> 00:24:42,480
十九号哨位 请报告情况
Post 19, please report. What's your status?

293
00:24:43,190 --> 00:24:45,920
一切正常 没发现什么可疑情况
All clear. There's really nothing going on here.

294
00:24:46,430 --> 00:24:48,425
埃塞俄比亚大主教…
The Archbishop of Ethiopia...

295
00:24:48,460 --> 00:24:51,050
总统先生稍后会颁发费城友谊奖章
The President will be awarding the Philadelphia Brotherhood Medal

296
00:24:51,070 --> 00:24:53,830
给埃塞俄比亚大主教 德斯蒙德·穆托姆博
to His Grace Desmond Mutumbo, the Archbishop of Ethiopia.

297
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:56,465
这位大主教一直是位有争议的人物
There's been some controversy surrounding the Archbishop

298
00:24:56,500 --> 00:24:59,770
因他常揭露发生在他的国家的暴行
as he's been speaking out regarding the atrocities in his country.

299
00:24:59,805 --> 00:25:02,240
他计划在此次颁奖结束后
He plans to meet with the President right after the ceremony

300
00:25:02,275 --> 00:25:03,670
与美国总统举行会谈
to discuss these matters.

301
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:06,080
这是伟大的时代
These are great times.

302
00:25:06,980 --> 00:25:09,310
是具有历史意义的时代
These are historic times.

303
00:25:09,320 --> 00:25:12,720
也是动荡不安的时代
And these are troubled times, as well.

304
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:16,860
贵国的这个奖章
This medal that your country...

305
00:25:16,895 --> 00:25:18,155
黄丝带
Yellow ribbons.

306
00:25:18,190 --> 00:25:20,850
对 那是用来向军队表达敬意的
Yeah, people put those up to remember the troops.

307
00:25:20,860 --> 00:25:23,190
应该放在树下吧
No, they tie those low around trees.

308
00:25:23,430 --> 00:25:25,470
这些是风向标
These are windage flags.

309
00:25:25,630 --> 00:25:27,130
由此判断 大概射击位置…
Roughly the location I'd have put them in

310
00:25:27,140 --> 00:25:28,730
会在教堂塔顶上
for a shot from the steeple.

311
00:25:28,770 --> 00:25:31,100
是的 有可能
Yeah. Maybe.

312
00:25:31,110 --> 00:25:33,260
绝对是 他是个行家里手
No, definitely. He knows what he's doing.

313
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:35,275
教堂方向安排狙击小组了吗?
You guys got a team in place to take out the church?

314
00:25:35,310 --> 00:25:38,240
如果那里有人 他们会在枪响之前采取行动
They'll move right before the shot is taken, when his focus is elsewhere.

315
00:25:38,250 --> 00:25:42,010
…那些对抗自由的势力渐渐抬头
...raises its head and confronts freedom,

316
00:25:42,020 --> 00:25:47,450
妄图把自由扼杀在摇篮里
but slyly, subtly, chokes it off at the root.

317
00:25:47,460 --> 00:25:51,250
我们的责任是…
And it is our responsibility

318
00:25:51,260 --> 00:25:53,590
彻底铲除这些有害的苗头
to find these dark weeds.

319
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:58,360
闪光已经抵达 重复一遍 闪光已经抵达
Flashlight has arrived. I say again, Flashlight has arrived.

320
00:26:00,600 --> 00:26:02,430
- 如果你刚打开电视… - 你好
- If you just joined us... - Hi.

321
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:05,170
提蒙斯警官 本地分局的
Officer Timmons, our local resource.

322
00:26:06,370 --> 00:26:07,770
这是鲍·李·史瓦格
Bob Lee Swagger.

323
00:26:09,410 --> 00:26:12,640
认识你非常荣幸
It is a real honor to meet you.

324
00:26:12,650 --> 00:26:14,440
你的枪套扣松开了
You're unsnapped, officer.

325
00:26:15,280 --> 00:26:17,910
我靠…
Shit. Oh, fuck.

326
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:20,280
丢了枪可麻烦了
Don't want to lose that now, do I?

327
00:26:20,290 --> 00:26:22,880
真的非常荣幸
Again, it's an honor.

328
00:26:25,690 --> 00:26:30,860
…我们为大国服务的…
...of our stewardship of this great...

329
00:26:30,870 --> 00:26:34,490
- 那个黑人是谁? - 他是埃塞俄比亚大主教
- That our guy in the collar? - The Archbishop of Ethiopia.

330
00:26:34,500 --> 00:26:36,789
来接受奖章 你知道的?
He's getting a medal. Know it?

331
00:26:36,790 --> 00:26:38,980
非洲之角 我知道
HOA. Horn of Africa. Yeah.

332
00:26:39,070 --> 00:26:41,105
我在那工作过
You know I worked there?

333
00:26:41,140 --> 00:26:43,040
"枪杀平民时你的 第一感觉是什么?"
You know what they say about the first thing that you feel

334
00:26:43,075 --> 00:26:45,277
知道他们怎么说吗?
when you shoot a civilian, right?

335
00:26:45,312 --> 00:26:47,480
"枪的后坐力"? 没错
- Recoil of your rifle? - Right.

336
00:26:47,515 --> 00:26:49,050
真有创意
That's very original.

337
00:26:49,850 --> 00:26:52,420
谢谢大主教分享 如此有启发性的演讲
Thank you, Archbishop, for those inspiring words.

338
00:26:52,455 --> 00:26:55,010
下面是总统讲话了
The President speaks next.

339
00:26:55,020 --> 00:26:56,390
各小组准备行动
All teams stand by.

340
00:26:57,760 --> 00:27:01,820
吉布森特工 报告收到 一切正常
Agent Gibson, we read your fly-by. Situation all clear, over.

341
00:27:01,860 --> 00:27:03,590
詹姆斯特工 一切正常
Agent James, all clear.

342
00:27:03,600 --> 00:27:05,720
现在我感到很荣幸…
Now it gives me enormous pleasure...

343
00:27:05,730 --> 00:27:07,770
风速每小时三英里 …向大家介绍接下来的嘉宾
- Got wind at three, full value. ...to introduce to you

344
00:27:07,800 --> 00:27:09,805
有请美国总统
the President of the United States.

345
00:27:09,840 --> 00:27:12,030
风向正中 修正角四点五度
Make it four-and-a-half minutes of angle.

346
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:15,000
静风修正三密耳
Three-mil hold, in case the wind dies.

347
00:27:38,470 --> 00:27:40,260
刺客上膛了
He's loaded.

348
00:27:40,270 --> 00:27:44,300
正在计算高度湿度还有温度
Altitude, humidity, temperature accounted for.

349
00:27:45,510 --> 00:27:48,010
…本市曾是国都…
In the city that was the capital of...

