We got to take him.

351
00:27:49,615 --> 00:27:51,140
还有十秒
Ten seconds.

352
00:27:51,150 --> 00:27:53,910
风向正好对他有利 马上动手吧
Wind matches his setup. Take him! Take him now!

353
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:55,410
派出紧急反应小队 快解决他…
Send in the ERT team. Take out the...

354
00:27:57,920 --> 00:27:59,510
有人开枪!
Shots fired! Shots fired!

355
00:28:14,770 --> 00:28:17,100
闪光倒下了!闪光倒下了
Flashlight is down, Flashlight is down.

356
00:28:17,110 --> 00:28:19,300
- 什么?闪光倒下了? - 重复一遍 闪光倒下了
- What? Flashlight down? - I say again. Flashlight is down.

357
00:28:19,310 --> 00:28:22,430
- 总统中弹了 - 情报很混乱…
- The President has been shot. - There's mass confusion...

358
00:28:22,610 --> 00:28:24,680
总统中弹了是吗?
Has the President been shot?

359
00:28:27,250 --> 00:28:28,540
枪手在教堂顶部
Right at the church steeple.

360
00:28:32,120 --> 00:28:33,350
你怎么会失手?
How could you miss?

361
00:28:34,120 --> 00:28:35,885
你他妈的怎么会失手?
How could you fucking miss?

362
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:39,190
三十秒内撤离现场 快去追
Thirty seconds, clear out. Chase him down.

363
00:28:39,225 --> 00:28:40,890
他受伤了 干掉他
He's bleeding. Kill him.

364
00:28:42,600 --> 00:28:44,930
指挥所呼叫秃鹰二号 马上出击
Command Post to Condor Two, load up, over.

365
00:28:44,965 --> 00:28:46,500
秃鹰二号正在准备
Condor Two loading up.

366
00:28:49,500 --> 00:28:51,160
快 快
Go, go, go, go, go!

367
00:28:57,450 --> 00:28:59,450
快点 大伙!
Hurry up, guys. Come on.

368
00:29:11,260 --> 00:29:14,260
秃鹰二号 指挥所呼叫 等候新命令
Condor Two, this is Command Post. Stand by for update, over.

369
00:29:14,295 --> 00:29:15,730
待命 完毕
Standing by, over.

370
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:18,800
指挥所
Command Post!

371
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:22,230
指挥所 十九号呼叫
Command Post! Command Post, this is Post 19.

372
00:29:22,240 --> 00:29:23,360
听到我说话吗?
You guys read me?

373
00:29:23,370 --> 00:29:24,530
- 我是否原地待命? - 求你…
- Should I hold post? - Please.

374
00:29:24,540 --> 00:29:26,900
帮帮我 他们向我开枪
Please help me. Please. They shot me.

375
00:29:26,910 --> 00:29:29,270
- 我是 FBI 举起手来 - 求你帮我
- FBI. Put your hands up! - Please. Hey.

376
00:29:31,410 --> 00:29:32,480
救我一命
Save me.

377
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:34,580
说什么?
What?

378
00:29:42,690 --> 00:29:44,125
车钥匙给我
Give me the keys.

379
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:46,920
我没枪杀总统 我被提蒙斯陷害了
I didn't shoot the President. Timmons was a setup.

380
00:29:48,430 --> 00:29:49,660
来人!
Help!

381
00:29:51,100 --> 00:29:53,500
我是 FBI 他抢了我的枪和车
FBI! Took my weapon and my car.

382
00:29:58,340 --> 00:30:01,100
别担心 他被我击中了两枪 你没事吗?
Don't worry, I already shot him twice. You all right?

383
00:30:01,110 --> 00:30:05,040
指挥所 能否描述嫌疑犯特征?
CP, 17, can you repeat possible suspect description?

384
00:30:05,050 --> 00:30:07,170
不能 没有进一步信息
Negative, no further at this time.

385
00:30:07,180 --> 00:30:09,810
指挥所 十五号呼叫 我这里一切正常
CP, this is 15. No activity at my location.

386
00:30:09,820 --> 00:30:11,980
随时可以转移位置
I am available to move if necessary.

387
00:30:11,990 --> 00:30:13,420
明白
Copy that.

388
00:30:17,190 --> 00:30:19,560
我是提蒙斯警官 请求支援
This is Officer Timmons requesting backup.

389
00:30:19,595 --> 00:30:21,590
我在追捕刺杀嫌疑犯
Pursuing suspect in assassination.

390
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:25,830
他抢了一辆 FBI 警车 沿宝石街向南逃窜
Now fleeing in stolen FBI vehicle, moving south on Front from Diamond.

391
00:30:25,870 --> 00:30:27,560
他持有武器 非常危险 我重复
Suspect is armed and dangerous. I repeat,

392
00:30:28,140 --> 00:30:29,790
疑犯持有武器 非常危险
suspect is armed and dangerous.

393
00:30:29,800 --> 00:30:32,235
费城全体警务人员注意
All Philly PD units be advised,

394
00:30:32,270 --> 00:30:35,270
疑犯驾驶 FBI 警车逃逸
assassination suspect is fleeing in a stolen FBI vehicle.

395
00:30:35,280 --> 00:30:38,070
正沿宝石街向南 往前沿大街逃窜
He is going south on Front from Diamond.

396
00:30:38,080 --> 00:30:41,150
秃鹰二号呼叫 正前往前沿大街
This is Condor 2. We are transitioning from roadhouse to Front Street.

397
00:30:41,185 --> 00:30:43,440
请提供嫌疑犯车辆详细情况
Please advise for further description of suspect vehicle.

398
00:30:43,450 --> 00:30:46,850
指挥所 419 呼叫 我正沿着汤姆森大街向南前进
Dispatch, 419, I'm heading south on Thompson.

399
00:30:46,885 --> 00:30:49,010
请告知车辆颜色或者其他特征
Do we have a color, anything on the vehicle?

400
00:30:54,560 --> 00:30:57,290
嫌疑犯的车辆…
Assassination suspect's vehicle

401
00:30:57,300 --> 00:31:01,230
为 06 款黑色福特皇冠 政府公用车
is one government-issue black 2006 Ford Crown Vic.

402
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:07,000
宾夕法尼亚州执照号码: 7317 JDE 完毕
Pennsylvania license number 7-3-1-7 James David Edward, over.

403
00:31:07,580 --> 00:31:10,240
嫌疑犯最后出现的位置在哪里
What was suspect's last known location? Over.

404
00:31:10,275 --> 00:31:12,540
在前沿大街南面
Last known is south on Front.

405
00:31:18,750 --> 00:31:22,380
这里是詹姆斯特工 嫌疑犯为多人还是一人?
This is Agent James. Do we have multiple suspects or a single suspect?

406
00:31:23,220 --> 00:31:26,955
詹姆斯特工 不能告知 暂时没有进一步资料
Agent James, negative. No further information...

407
00:31:26,990 --> 00:31:30,720
这里是皮特曼特工 车辆沿卡斯特大街高速行驶
This is Agent Pittman. Car seen going high speed on Castor.

408
00:31:30,730 --> 00:31:32,890
沿卡斯特大街高速行驶 请注意
High speed on Castor. Be advised.

409
00:31:39,570 --> 00:31:40,870
是提蒙斯报警的吗?
Timmons called it in?

410
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:43,175
是的 完全按计划
Right on time, like he was supposed to.

411
00:31:43,210 --> 00:31:45,040
只是没来得及补上一枪 是…但他身中两枪
- Before he shot him again. - Yeah, well, he's been hit twice,

412
00:31:45,050 --> 00:31:47,880
除非他有本事自己止血
so unless he can stop the bleeding without going to the hospital or a doctor,

413
00:31:47,915 --> 00:31:49,110
否则他活不了多久
it doesn't really matter.

414
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:53,180
不出二十分钟就会发现 他死在某个街角的垃圾桶旁
They're going to find him lying dead by a dumpster in an alley in 20 minutes.

415
00:31:53,250 --> 00:31:54,320
你的位置在哪?
What is your location?

416
00:32:05,430 --> 00:32:08,760
嫌疑犯车辆为 黑色轿车 四门…
Suspect vehicle a black sedan, four-door...

417
00:32:24,620 --> 00:32:25,740
所有单位请注意
All units be advised,

418
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:29,290
有目击者报告嫌疑犯进入位于…
eyewitness reports suspect vehicle entering High-Tech Car Wash

419
00:32:29,325 --> 00:32:32,220
杰拉德大街和九号街 西北角的自动洗车房
on the northwest corner of Girard and 9th, over.

420
00:32:32,230 --> 00:32:33,255
指挥所请注意
Command Post be advised,

421
00:32:33,290 --> 00:32:35,830
秃鹰二号正在赶往嫌疑犯所在位置
this is Condor Two en route to suspect location, over.

422
00:32:35,865 --> 00:32:38,420
指挥所 秃鹰三号马上赶到
Command Post, Condor Three copies. All en route.

423
00:32:43,100 --> 00:32:44,900
- 哟 伙计 - 小心点 伙计
- Yo, man! - Watch it, man!

424
00:33:05,130 --> 00:33:06,280
靠…
Shit!

425
00:33:22,780 --> 00:33:25,940
指挥所 秃鹰二号 和三号进入拦截位置
Command Post, Condors Two and Three moving to intercept, over.

426
00:33:58,650 --> 00:34:01,310
嫌疑犯车辆在九十五号 桥底与卡车相撞
Suspect vehicle collided with a truck under the 95.

427
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:03,210
他位于市场街与哥伦布大街交界
He's at Market and Columbus.

428
00:34:05,120 --> 00:34:08,550
情况不错 车辆受损停下了 重复 车辆受损停下了
Looks good. Vehicle is disabled. Repeat, vehicle disabled.

429
00:34:18,900 --> 00:34:20,560
干掉他 开枪!
Take him down! Fire!

430
00:34:45,560 --> 00:34:48,920
发现一辆福特皇冠车 黑色 政府牌照
I got a Crown Vic. Black. Government plates.

431
00:34:48,930 --> 00:34:51,120
前排座位有尸体吗?
Dead guy in the front seat?

432
00:34:54,540 --> 00:34:58,730
马上给我开始封锁三十英里长的河道
I want the banks of this river lined for 30 miles, five minutes ago.

433
00:34:58,870 --> 00:35:00,910
往下游搜索
All right. Let's start the search downriver.

434
00:35:21,600 --> 00:35:25,260
我正在采访提蒙斯警官 他徒步追捕了嫌疑犯
I'm here with Officer Timmons, who pursued the suspect on foot.

435
00:35:25,500 --> 00:35:27,930
警官 可以告诉我们事发经过吗?
Officer, can you tell us what happened?

436
00:37:08,540 --> 00:37:11,035
嫌疑犯身份目前已经确定为…
The would-be assassin, tentatively identified

437
00:37:11,070 --> 00:37:14,660
退役陆战队枪炮军士 鲍·李·史瓦格
as retired Marine Gunnery Sergeant Bob Lee Swagger,

438
00:37:14,680 --> 00:37:20,640
数千名州警和联邦警察正在 动员起来对他进行围追堵截
is being pursued by thousands of State and Federal law enforcement personnel as we speak.

439
00:37:20,650 --> 00:37:24,480
警方布下了天罗地网 但没发现史瓦格的踪迹
As the net begins to tighten nationwide, there is still no trace of Swagger.

440
00:37:24,490 --> 00:37:26,880
仅仅在德拉瓦河底…
Nothing but an abandoned car has been found

441
00:37:26,890 --> 00:37:28,850
发现了被遗弃的汽车
at the bottom of the Delaware River.

442
00:37:28,860 --> 00:37:32,590
服役七年的费城资深 警官史丹利·提蒙斯…
Seven-year veteran Philadelphia police officer Stanley Timmons,

443
00:37:32,625 --> 00:37:34,180
最早赶到事发现场
first to respond to the scene,

444
00:37:34,200 --> 00:37:37,290
并开了三枪把史瓦格打伤
is believed to have shot and injured Swagger.

445
00:37:37,300 --> 00:37:42,660
据报道 他至少被枪击中两次
Early reports indicate that the assailant may have been hit as many as two times.

446
00:37:42,670 --> 00:37:45,500
同时 FBI 不愿对…
Meanwhile, the FBI has been unwilling to comment

447
00:37:45,510 --> 00:37:47,900
其手下一名特工…
on information that an agent of theirs

448
00:37:47,910 --> 00:37:52,140
受到史瓦格攻击并被 缴械的事情发表评论
was assaulted and disarmed by Swagger as he fled the scene,

449
00:37:52,150 --> 00:37:54,710
随后驾驶抢走的 FBI 特工的车逃离现场
possibly in a stolen FBI vehicle.

450
00:37:54,720 --> 00:37:58,340
目前 尚未有史瓦格的任何消息
At this time, no sign of Swagger has been found.

451
00:37:58,350 --> 00:38:00,510
你让我们感到非常难堪
You have embarrassed this office.

452
00:38:00,520 --> 00:38:05,020
局里的人士监管部门 将对你进行严格的审查
You will be facing a review from the Office of Professional Responsibility.

453
00:38:05,030 --> 00:38:06,110
长官?
Sir...

454
00:38:07,530 --> 00:38:09,395
我并不感到难堪
Well, I don't feel embarrassed.

455
00:38:09,430 --> 00:38:11,460
他是陆战队强侦连狙击手…
A Force Recon Marine Scout Sniper

456
00:38:11,470 --> 00:38:14,470
而我刚从警校毕业三个星期
disarmed me three weeks out of the academy.

457
00:38:14,505 --> 00:38:17,730
我能活着就很不错了
If anything, I feel lucky to be alive.

458
00:38:25,180 --> 00:38:27,680
为何他要说自己没杀总统?
Why'd he say he didn't shoot the President?

459
00:38:27,715 --> 00:38:29,150
因为他没打中
Because he didn't.

460
00:38:32,920 --> 00:38:35,890
他还说提蒙斯陷害他
Also, he said Timmons was a setup.

461
00:38:35,925 --> 00:38:37,285
他没这样说
He never said that.

462
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:39,550
一个市警能把他打伤两次
City cop managed to spot, shoot this guy twice.

463
00:38:39,560 --> 00:38:41,150
令你很丢脸
You got your ass kicked.

464
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:42,660
你记错了
You're misremembering.

465
00:38:43,100 --> 00:38:45,500
在极度压力下是常有的事
That's normal under extreme stress events.

466
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:48,945
你刚才所说的要作为正式记录吗?
Have you given your official statement yet?

467
00:38:48,980 --> 00:38:51,490
要是我就会说话谨慎
Because I would be very cautious about what went in it.

468
00:38:51,510 --> 00:38:55,770
也许我该等调查报告 出来后再回忆一下
Well, maybe I should wait for the report to come out, read it and then remember.

469
00:38:55,980 --> 00:38:58,040
你相信那家伙吗?
Can you believe this fucking guy?

470
00:39:00,380 --> 00:39:01,640
这就对了
There you go.

471
00:39:02,420 --> 00:39:03,510
- 什么事? - 新的情报送来了
- Yes? - The raw feeds are in

472
00:39:03,520 --> 00:39:04,520
是电视台消息
from the networks.

473
00:39:22,770 --> 00:39:26,470
情报有了意外进展 华盛顿特区…
...development, security camera footage from Washington, D.C.

474
00:39:26,505 --> 00:39:28,505
以及费城一些监控 摄像机画面显示…
And several locations in Philadelphia

475
00:39:28,540 --> 00:39:31,870
嫌疑犯鲍·李·史瓦格军士…
shows the suspect, Gunnery Sergeant Bob Lee Swagger,

476
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:35,940
曾去过那些地方 寻找 射击位置并记录风向数据
scouting shooting locations, traveling and taking wind readings.

477
00:39:36,050 --> 00:39:40,920
尽管警方在全国范围内加紧搜捕 但仍未发现史瓦格的踪影
As the net begins to tighten nationwide, there is still no trace of Swagger.

478
00:40:10,450 --> 00:40:11,710
对不起
Excuse me.

479
00:40:11,720 --> 00:40:14,910
刚刚停电了 不能营业了
Can't sell you nothing. Just lost our power.

480
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:17,250
我付现金 不用找零钱
Please. I got cash, and you can keep the change.

481
00:40:17,260 --> 00:40:19,055
可我没办法找东西
Ain't gonna be able to find nothing.

482
00:40:19,090 --> 00:40:21,660
我只需要注射针头盐 糖
Please, all I need is a marinade needle, some salt, some sugar,

483
00:40:21,695 --> 00:40:23,230
还有一些水
couple bottles of water.

484
00:40:24,060 --> 00:40:25,150
要多少?
How many?

485
00:41:11,110 --> 00:41:14,240
先生对不起 我感到很遗憾
Well, sir, I'm sorry. I'm sorry to hear that.

486
00:41:14,250 --> 00:41:16,840
我敢肯定她是个非常虔诚的基督徒
I'm sure she's a really nice Christian woman

487
00:41:16,850 --> 00:41:19,780
但我们不处理此类事务
but we don't take care of those things here.

488
00:41:19,790 --> 00:41:21,950
- 好吧… - FBI 公布了一个录像
- Yeah. Okay, well... - The FBI released a video letter...

489
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:24,014
去咨询专家吧 …威胁要取总统性命
...see a counselor. ...threatening the life of the President...

490
00:41:24,015 --> 00:41:24,870
可以联系《菲尔博士》或类似的 好的
Dr. Phil or something. Okay.

491
00:41:25,230 --> 00:41:27,555
是十天前鲍·李·史瓦格寄出的
...signed and dated by Bob Lee Swagger just 10 days ago.

492
00:41:27,590 --> 00:41:32,590
联邦特工搜查了怀俄明风河地区
Federal agents today executed a search warrant in the Wind River range of Wyoming

493
00:41:32,600 --> 00:41:35,850
史瓦格在那里居住过数年时间
where Swagger had been living for several years.

494
00:41:35,885 --> 00:41:39,100
同时 FBI 一直不愿对…
In the meantime, the FBI has been unwilling to comment,

495
00:41:39,110 --> 00:41:41,540
史瓦格下落不明的事情发表评论
as no sign of Swagger has been found.

496
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:44,840
- 有线索了吗? - 没
- Get anything? - No.

497
00:42:46,470 --> 00:42:48,300
好的 在什么地方?
Yeah, wait, wait. Where was this?

498
00:43:00,720 --> 00:43:01,850
还有呢?
And? Yes?

499
00:43:01,860 --> 00:43:05,120
她怀疑就是他 不过 当时停电周围很黑
She thinks it was him, but it was dark because the power was out in the store.

500
00:43:05,130 --> 00:43:06,525
- 他买了什么? - 最好没错
- What'd he buy? - Gotta be.

501
00:43:06,560 --> 00:43:09,650
盐糖水和注射针头
Salt, sugar, water, and a marinade injector.

502
00:43:09,660 --> 00:43:11,095
这家伙想吃烧烤?
Guy going to a barbecue.

503
00:43:11,130 --> 00:43:13,830
盐水注射针头可以用来打点滴
Salt, water, an injector could be used for an IV,

504
00:43:13,870 --> 00:43:14,990
可糖用来干什么?
but what's with the sugar?

505
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:16,360
等一下!
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold that! Hold that!

506
00:43:16,370 --> 00:43:18,060
糖在战场上一直用来处理伤口
Well, sugar's been used to treat battlefield wounds

507
00:43:18,070 --> 00:43:19,105
已经有几百年历史
for hundreds of years.

508
00:43:19,140 --> 00:43:21,470
当然必须依靠渗透压力才行
It has something to do with osmotic pressure.

509
00:43:21,480 --> 00:43:23,975
这在拿破仑战争中司空见惯
It was popular during the Napoleonic War.

510
00:43:24,010 --> 00:43:26,580
你在报告中提到拿破仑战争
You go into Howard's office with the Napoleonic War,

511
00:43:26,615 --> 00:43:27,870
霍华德局长会送你去精神病院
he's gonna put you on psych leave.

512
00:43:27,880 --> 00:43:30,210
回去办公 别让自己毁了
Go back to your desk. I'm saving your life.

513
00:43:52,070 --> 00:43:53,140
其中一点…
One thing is...

514
00:43:59,380 --> 00:44:01,110
…一七九零年到一八零零年…
...1790 to 1800.

515
00:44:02,350 --> 00:44:03,420
其中一点…
One thing is...

516
00:44:23,950 --> 00:44:27,050
(温布尔登杯赢家)

517
00:44:29,440 --> 00:44:31,500
肯塔基州 肯尼市

518
00:45:19,730 --> 00:45:21,020
打扰了 夫人
I'm sorry to bother you, ma'am.

519
00:45:21,030 --> 00:45:22,525
我知道你是谁
I know who you are.

520
00:45:22,560 --> 00:45:25,530
你是鲍·李·史瓦格 唐尼以前的拍档
You're Bob Lee. Swagger. Donnie's old partner.

521
00:45:25,565 --> 00:45:28,260
我没枪杀总统
Look, I didn't shoot the President.

522
00:45:28,270 --> 00:45:29,460
我知道
I know.

523
00:45:29,470 --> 00:45:30,560
你知道?
You do?

524
00:45:30,570 --> 00:45:34,200
死的不是总统 是埃塞俄比亚大主教
The President's not dead. Ethiopian Archbishop is.

525
00:45:36,140 --> 00:45:38,800
谁会想杀他啊?
Why in the hell would somebody want to shoot him?

526
00:45:39,450 --> 00:45:40,670
你是护士吧?
Look, you're a nurse, right?

527
00:45:40,680 --> 00:45:45,380
不 那只是唐尼的愿望 我晕血
No. No, that was Donnie's dream. I couldn't stand the blood.

528
00:45:45,390 --> 00:45:46,680
我是小学教师
I teach the third grade.

529
00:45:47,290 --> 00:45:48,980
- 帮帮我 - 你应该离开
- Please. - Look, you should go.

530
00:45:48,990 --> 00:45:51,450
帮帮我
Please.

531
00:45:51,690 --> 00:45:53,780
我是被陷害的
I didn't do whatever they said I did.

532
00:45:54,290 --> 00:45:55,360
我发誓
I swear.

533
00:45:55,760 --> 00:45:58,090
我遇到麻烦了 需要帮助
I'm in some bad trouble and I need some help.

534
00:45:58,100 --> 00:46:00,720
我不会跑那么远来对你撒谎的
I wouldn't have come all the way here to lie to you.

535
00:46:04,100 --> 00:46:06,900
你打算朝我开枪?
You still figuring on shooting me?

536
00:46:06,910 --> 00:46:09,975
那霰弹枪太长了 不方便
Only that shotgurs a little long to bring up fast.

537
00:46:10,010 --> 00:46:13,040
如果要下手就快点
Look, if you're going to do it, just get it over with.

538
00:46:13,050 --> 00:46:15,110
我走投无路了
I ain't got nowhere else to go.

539
00:46:18,250 --> 00:46:22,080
把车停到车库 邻居很快会起床
Pull the truck in the garage. The neighbors'll be up in a minute.

540
00:46:22,090 --> 00:46:23,710
叫我莎拉
You'd best call me Sarah.

541
00:46:23,720 --> 00:46:25,020
好的
All right.

542
00:46:40,240 --> 00:46:42,500
警察局 请问有什么事?
911, what's your emergency?

543
00:47:11,100 --> 00:47:12,230
你好?
Hello?

544
00:47:12,240 --> 00:47:14,170
这里是警察局 我们刚才接到你的电话
This is 911. We received a hang-up from this location.

545
00:47:14,205 --> 00:47:16,800
邻居的狗碰倒了垃圾桶
Yeah, neighbor's dog knocked over the trash cans

546
00:47:16,810 --> 00:47:19,400
吓了我一跳 现在没事了 谢谢了
and scared the hell out of me. Everything's fine. Thanks.

547
00:47:19,410 --> 00:47:20,480
那就好
Okay, then.

548
00:47:26,490 --> 00:47:29,750
如果打电话报警不说话
Seems you call the police and hang up without saying anything,

549
00:47:29,760 --> 00:47:31,920
他们会很负责的打过来询问
they call you back right away.

550
00:47:38,060 --> 00:47:40,530
我早就应该来看你
I should've come and seen you in person.

551
00:47:43,500 --> 00:47:45,450
应该在出事之前
Before. I mean, then.

552
00:47:45,485 --> 00:47:47,400
我收到你的信了
Yeah, I read the letter.

553
00:47:49,380 --> 00:47:50,770
没关系
It was okay.

554
00:47:52,750 --> 00:47:55,040
还有你每年寄来的花
And once a year I got the flowers.

555
00:47:57,480 --> 00:47:59,070
你看来很糟
You don't look real good.

556
00:48:00,420 --> 00:48:04,390
我这回是大难不死 我撑了一晚
I'm supposed to be dead. Been a long night.

557
00:48:04,425 --> 00:48:06,425
怎么逃出来的?
Why aren't you?

558
00:48:06,460 --> 00:48:08,930
美国政府花了大量时间金钱
Well, the U.S. Government spent a lot of time and money

559
00:48:08,965 --> 00:48:10,795
教会我如何死里逃生
teaching me how not to die

560
00:48:10,830 --> 00:48:13,420
当然也教会我如何杀人
after they got done teaching me how to kill people.

561
00:48:14,700 --> 00:48:17,130
你想让我帮你什么?
So how is it I'm supposed to help you?

562
00:48:18,310 --> 00:48:22,600
你会用十字绣针法 帮我把伤口缝一下吗?
You can do a running cross-stitch, finish it with an embroidery knot?

563
00:48:22,610 --> 00:48:23,680
会
Yeah.

564
00:48:33,520 --> 00:48:35,610
最好去不同商店买
You got to try to spread it out.

565
00:48:35,620 --> 00:48:38,090
集中购买容易引起怀疑
It's gonna look odd you buy it all in one place.

566
00:48:38,470 --> 00:48:43,030
一幅外科手套两瓶酒精两尺长的导管 一包厨房海绵热水瓶两把手术剪刀…

567
00:48:46,100 --> 00:48:49,030
这三年怎么感觉像十年一样漫长?
How can it be three years ago when it seems like ten?

568
00:48:52,840 --> 00:48:54,570
因为我们很痛苦
Mileage can be rough.

569
00:49:05,850 --> 00:49:07,710
竟然还有比我早的
No one ever beats me in.

570
00:49:14,990 --> 00:49:16,360
你没回家?
You never left.

571
00:49:17,160 --> 00:49:19,390
局里的人都认为我疯了
Everyone keeps telling me I'm crazy.

572
00:49:19,400 --> 00:49:22,630
好像我看见的听见的都是假的
Like I didn't see what I saw, or heard what I heard.

573
00:49:23,600 --> 00:49:26,170
我没疯 你觉得呢?
I'm not crazy, though. You think I'm crazy?

574
00:49:27,440 --> 00:49:29,670
这些情报从哪得到的?
Where did all this stuff come from?

575
00:49:30,020 --> 00:49:33,170
一开始我以为是来自华盛顿附近的匡恩提科
At first I thought it was Washington, Quantico.

576
00:49:33,480 --> 00:49:37,445
结果不是这么回事 像变魔术一样送来了
I checked and it didn't. It just magically arrived.

577
00:49:37,480 --> 00:49:41,990
他们来自协助机构烟酒枪支管理局 国家侦察局还有不知名的部门
Cooperating agencies, ATF, NRO, places that don't even have initials

578
00:49:42,025 --> 00:49:44,890
他们在出现紧急状况时提供合作
they cooperate in times of national emergency.

579
00:49:45,390 --> 00:49:46,620
你需要休息一下了
You need to get some sleep.

580
00:49:46,630 --> 00:49:49,490
要知道枪击发生后二十二分钟
You know that the first ballistics diagram got here

581
00:49:49,500 --> 00:49:51,430
这里就获得了第一张弹道图
22 minutes after the shooting.

582
00:49:51,465 --> 00:49:52,550
我们工作效率高
We're good at our jobs.

583
00:49:52,560 --> 00:49:55,130
十二分钟时 警方派出了直升机
12 minutes after the shooting, they were still scrambling choppers.

584
00:49:55,165 --> 00:49:56,360
并且封锁了现场
The scene was locked down.

585
00:49:57,600 --> 00:50:00,970
他们是怎么在随后的 十分钟内完成检测的?
How did they get a reverse azimuth 10 minutes after that?

586
00:50:01,005 --> 00:50:02,170
我们是吃官饭的
I mean, we work for the federal government.

587
00:50:02,205 --> 00:50:03,610
不会有那么高效率
We're not that good at our jobs.

588
00:50:04,380 --> 00:50:06,070
- 想看东西不? - 可能不想
- You want to see something? - Probably not.

589
00:50:06,080 --> 00:50:07,540
这是我下载的
I downloaded this.

590
00:50:07,550 --> 00:50:08,770
这是史瓦格两年前
This is a full-scale printout

591
00:50:08,780 --> 00:50:11,870
在九百码射击目标的全尺寸图
of a target Swagger shot two years ago at 1,000 yards.

592
00:50:11,880 --> 00:50:15,215
我在上面打了孔 那是一次比赛
I punched in the holes myself. It was at a competition.

593
00:50:15,250 --> 00:50:20,090
我读过一篇文章说史瓦格 有百步穿杨的硬功夫
I read an article. It said Swagger shot a silver dollar at a grand.

594
00:50:20,125 --> 00:50:21,390
五发子弹
Five shots,

595
00:50:21,630 --> 00:50:22,960
在一千码距离
at 1,000 yards,

596
00:50:23,100 --> 00:50:25,460
落点在一英尺半!
an inch-and-a-half spread. An inch and a half!

597
00:50:27,730 --> 00:50:29,320
…这城市曾经是国都…
It was the capital of the United States...

598
00:50:29,330 --> 00:50:32,960
那是总统身后的旗子 几乎纹丝不动
That's the flag behind the President. It's barely waving.

599
00:50:32,970 --> 00:50:34,500
这是国家气象局给出的
This is the wind speed and direction

600
00:50:34,510 --> 00:50:35,870
事发时的风速和风向数据
according to the National Weather Service

601
00:50:35,905 --> 00:50:38,270
我测算了一下
at the time of the shot. I did the math.

602
00:50:38,280 --> 00:50:41,010
枪法那么精准的人…
Now, how does a man who can do that

603
00:50:41,750 --> 00:50:45,080
在两千码距离射击竟然偏2.5英尺
miss by two-and-a-half feet at 2,000 yards?

604
00:50:45,650 --> 00:50:46,880
我不明白
I don't get it.

605
00:50:46,890 --> 00:50:49,820
你熬了一整夜 别管它了 去睡吧
You've had a long night. Let it go and get some sleep.

606
00:50:49,855 --> 00:50:52,050
我看了提蒙斯的采访
You know, I saw Timmons interviewed.

607
00:50:52,060 --> 00:50:54,355
他说当时在步行巡逻
He said he was walking foot patrol,

608
00:50:54,390 --> 00:50:57,090
看到有步枪从窗口伸了出来
saw a rifle barrel sticking out of a window,

609
00:50:57,100 --> 00:50:59,565
于是上去检查 他向史瓦格开枪
went upstairs to investigate, and shot Swagger.

610
00:50:59,600 --> 00:51:02,030
狙击手是绝不会把枪伸出窗外的
No sniper sticks his rifle out of a window.

611
00:51:02,065 --> 00:51:04,900
他们会隐蔽处射击
They shoot from cover, back in the room.

612
00:51:05,170 --> 00:51:07,200
这完全不合逻辑
It doesn't make any sense.

613
00:51:09,340 --> 00:51:11,100
- 我要去找提蒙斯谈谈 - 你不能谈
- I'm gonna talk to Timmons. - No, you're not.

614
00:51:11,110 --> 00:51:13,300
为什么?他们真开除我?
Why? 'Cause they're gonna fire me if I do?

615
00:51:14,110 --> 00:51:16,910
提蒙斯昨晚在巷子里 被抢劫犯杀死了
Timmons was killed by a mugger in an alley last night.

616
00:51:20,920 --> 00:51:23,080
搞阴谋总离不开杀人灭口
In a conspiracy, all loose ends are trimmed.

617
00:51:23,400 --> 00:51:25,360
就像杰克·路比打死了奥斯华德?
Jack Ruby shoots Oswald?

618
00:51:25,590 --> 00:51:27,680
好人不一定有好报
Bad things happen to good people.

619
00:51:27,690 --> 00:51:28,820
可这也太快了
Yeah, not that quick, they don't.

620
00:51:34,770 --> 00:51:37,270
我暂时把血止住了
Well, I stopped the bleeding temporarily.

621
00:51:38,100 --> 00:51:40,430
不过恐怕还会再流
But it'll cut loose again.

622
00:51:40,440 --> 00:51:43,840
我只能延缓感染的发生 你必须帮我…
I held off the worst of the infection, but you're gonna have to open it up,

623
00:51:43,875 --> 00:51:46,740
把创伤清理干净
cut out and scrub away anything that's dead,

624
00:51:46,750 --> 00:51:49,710
然后把伤口再缝上
working your way out, sewing it together

625
00:51:49,720 --> 00:51:52,610
千万注意不能发生二次感染
and you got to try to make sure you don't re-infect it.

626
00:51:54,950 --> 00:51:56,490
准备好了吗?
You ready for this?

627
00:51:58,720 --> 00:52:01,520
我吸了一氧化氮后就会昏过去
I'm going to do all those Whip-It! 's and pass out.

628
00:52:04,600 --> 00:52:06,030
祝你成功
Good luck, okay?

629
00:53:19,910 --> 00:53:23,410
我需要你制订一个刺杀总统的计划
I need you to plan a presidential assassination.

630
00:53:23,445 --> 00:53:24,940
那个黑人是谁?
That our guy in the collar?

631
00:53:24,975 --> 00:53:26,270
哪国总统?
Whose president?

632
00:53:26,280 --> 00:53:27,745
我没有叫你执行
I didn't say "execute".

633
00:53:27,780 --> 00:53:30,780
来接受奖章 你知道的?
He's getting a medal. Know it?

634
00:53:30,815 --> 00:53:33,110
埃塞俄比亚大主教
The Archbishop of Ethiopia.

635
00:53:37,420 --> 00:53:39,010
你必须找到那枪手
You need to find the shooter.

636
00:53:42,260 --> 00:53:43,330
不
No.

637
00:55:36,580 --> 00:55:39,300
两天半时间身中两枪 竟然找不到?
Two and a half days, shot twice, no sign?

638
00:55:39,310 --> 00:55:40,775
必须找到他
Find me something.

639
00:55:40,810 --> 00:55:43,070
也许他钻进某个地洞里死了
Maybe he crawled into a hole and died.

640
00:55:44,180 --> 00:55:45,940
他没死
He's not dead.

641
00:55:47,690 --> 00:55:49,190
对他进行全面调查
Tear apart his life.

642
00:55:49,225 --> 00:55:50,620
再查
Again.

643
00:55:55,730 --> 00:55:56,890
成功了?
Go okay?

644
00:56:02,130 --> 00:56:03,600
我一直在做梦
I've been hallucinating.

645
00:56:06,510 --> 00:56:08,540
我得告诉你一件事
Something I need to tell you.

646
00:56:11,680 --> 00:56:13,310
来福死了
Ralphie's dead.

647
00:56:13,345 --> 00:56:14,940
谁是来福?
Who's Ralphie?

648
00:56:15,950 --> 00:56:17,510
他们说你把狗杀了
Well, they said you shot your dog

649
00:56:17,520 --> 00:56:19,520
因为知道自己有去无回
'cause you knew you werert coming back.

650
00:56:19,555 --> 00:56:21,090
他们说的?
They said that, huh?

651
00:56:25,390 --> 00:56:26,920
它叫山姆
Name was Sam.

652
00:56:27,930 --> 00:56:30,490
是条好狗 我从小把它养大
He was a good dog. I raised him from a pup.

653
00:56:34,470 --> 00:56:35,760
你还好吗?
You okay?

654
00:56:37,640 --> 00:56:38,700
不
No.

655
00:56:39,770 --> 00:56:41,570
你有什么打算?
What are you gonna do?

656
00:56:42,940 --> 00:56:44,700
我要先养好伤
I'll get better.

657
00:56:46,480 --> 00:56:49,070
然后查清事情真相
Then I'm going to burn their playhouse down.

658
00:56:53,940 --> 00:56:59,820
哪种武器系统要求脚架的尺寸是43*43*29英寸?

659
00:57:07,220 --> 00:57:11,910
简单 M3可支撑多种枪械 最多到50口径重机枪

660
00:57:16,120 --> 00:57:18,300
这种系统为什么要接上100米长1/4英寸宽的电缆?

661
00:57:24,850 --> 00:57:26,040
有何贵干?
Can I help you?

662
00:57:30,670 --> 00:57:32,760
看看这个网站:www.precisionremotes.com

663
00:57:44,460 --> 00:57:47,850
陷阱式T-250D战术遥控系统

664
00:57:54,950 --> 00:57:56,170
别动
Hold still.

665
00:58:07,690 --> 00:58:09,660
我一直想问你
I been meaning to ask you.

666
00:58:10,300 --> 00:58:12,060
你有男朋友吗?
You have a boyfriend?

667
00:58:14,000 --> 00:58:15,120
怎么?
Why?

668
00:58:16,230 --> 00:58:18,930
难道要我一辈子守寡?
Am I still supposed to be the grieving widow?

669
00:58:18,940 --> 00:58:20,700
唐尼去世三年了
It's been three years.

670
00:58:20,710 --> 00:58:21,770
不
No.

671
00:58:22,240 --> 00:58:23,770
我只想知道 如果有人擅自闯入…
Just wonder if I'm gonna have to shoot somebody

672
00:58:23,780 --> 00:58:27,080
我是否应该朝他开枪
walks through that door without knocking, wondering where you've been.

673
00:58:29,250 --> 00:58:30,940
没有
Well, no.

674
00:58:30,950 --> 00:58:33,280
目前没有稳定的男朋友
Nothing steady. No boyfriend.

675
00:58:57,810 --> 00:58:59,200
还不错嘛
Not bad.

676
00:59:00,380 --> 00:59:02,140
只是伤口有点僵硬
A little stiff, but...

677
00:59:03,850 --> 00:59:04,910
嘿
Hey.

678
00:59:06,050 --> 00:59:08,840
你可以当一名好护士
You know, you would've made one hell of a nurse.

679
00:59:09,980 --> 00:59:11,950
你表现的非常勇敢
That was really brave, what you did.

680
00:59:12,220 --> 00:59:13,480
你救了我
You saved my life.

681
00:59:17,430 --> 00:59:20,190
我好点了 我该走了
I'm better. I better get to it.

682
00:59:20,200 --> 00:59:22,630
他们绝不会停止寻找你的
They're never gonna stop chasing you.

683
00:59:23,640 --> 00:59:24,830
相信我
Never.

684
00:59:26,000 --> 00:59:28,270
他们绝不会放过你
They're never gonna stop looking.

685
00:59:30,040 --> 00:59:33,410
除了找我他们还会找另外一个人
In the meantime, they need someone else to find.

686
00:59:33,445 --> 00:59:35,000
我会把他送入虎口
I'm going to give them him.

687
00:59:35,010 --> 00:59:36,580
你说什么?
Excuse me?

688
00:59:37,650 --> 00:59:40,840
很可能收到一石二鸟的效果
May be a way to get two birds with that stone, too.

689
00:59:49,260 --> 00:59:51,230
- 史瓦格? - 嘿
- Swagger? - Hey.

690
01:00:00,940 --> 01:00:03,770
这是唐尼小时候的猎枪
The gun Donnie learned to hunt with when he was a kid.

691
01:00:05,410 --> 01:00:08,915
看着不起眼 但非常准
It ain't much, but it shoots true.

692
01:00:08,950 --> 01:00:11,480
我藏起它之前擦过和上过油
I cleaned and oiled it before I put it away.

693
01:00:11,515 --> 01:00:12,640
给我?
You sure?

694
01:00:13,790 --> 01:00:14,850
是的
Yeah.

695
01:00:19,090 --> 01:00:20,560
当初他们来找你…
Why'd you go?

696
01:00:21,230 --> 01:00:23,090
为何当答应他们?
When they came to see you.

697
01:00:25,400 --> 01:00:27,660
他们知道我的弱点
They know which buttons to press.

698
01:00:28,400 --> 01:00:30,560
我过于轻信别人 只要你说出你是爱国者
I'm still enough of a sucker, you press that patriot button,

699
01:00:30,570 --> 01:00:34,260
我就会说"要我干什么都干"
I'll sit up in my chair and say, "Which way you want me to go, boss?"

700
01:00:34,270 --> 01:00:38,000
我不认为这值得骄傲 但也不觉得羞耻
I mean, I ain't real proud of it, but I ain't ashamed, either.

701
01:00:39,280 --> 01:00:40,740
我有个计划
You know, I got a plan,

702
01:00:42,080 --> 01:00:44,440
可能需要你的帮助
but I think I'm going to need your help.

703
01:00:44,520 --> 01:00:46,550
好的 我会帮你
Okay. I'll do it.

704
01:00:47,150 --> 01:00:49,580
可我还没说要干什么
I haven't even told you what it is yet.

705
01:00:50,060 --> 01:00:51,280
我知道
I know.

706
01:00:59,060 --> 01:01:00,260
听着
Look.

707
01:01:01,230 --> 01:01:02,570
都怪我不好
It was my fault.

708
01:01:05,270 --> 01:01:06,340
什么?
What?

709
01:01:09,810 --> 01:01:12,070
如果不是我 唐尼一定不会死
You know, with Donnie. I should never have...

710
01:01:19,050 --> 01:01:20,140
什么?
What?

711
01:01:25,220 --> 01:01:26,950
你怎么敢这么说?
Don't you dare.

712
01:01:28,890 --> 01:01:32,050
你不能把责任都揽到自己身上
Don't you try and take that away from him.

713
01:01:33,000 --> 01:01:36,830
他知道为什么参军
He knew exactly what he was doing when he enlisted.

714
01:01:36,840 --> 01:01:40,900
参加侦察兵狙击手训练的时候 也知道自己在做什么
He knew exactly what he was doing when he enrolled in scout sniper training.

715
01:01:42,540 --> 01:01:44,580
他热爱自己的职业
He loved what he did.

716
01:01:44,615 --> 01:01:46,640
没人强迫他
No one made him do it.

717
01:01:48,980 --> 01:01:51,210
你不必感到内疚
That ain't yours to carry.

718
01:01:54,450 --> 01:01:55,750
好吧
You're right.

719
01:01:57,260 --> 01:01:58,790
对不起 是我不好
I'm sorry I tried.

720
01:02:24,810 --> 01:02:26,170
没事的
It's okay.

721
01:02:32,090 --> 01:02:34,450
我需要你找一个 FBI 探员
I need you to meet with this FBI agent.

722
01:02:34,460 --> 01:02:37,285
利用他把约翰逊引出来
Use him to flush Johnson out of his hiding place.

723
01:02:37,320 --> 01:02:41,420
你只要告诉他车辆识别码 他就会按课本上教他的去做
Give him the vehicle ID number. He'll do what he's trained to do.

724
01:02:41,430 --> 01:02:44,000
然后你就马上离开 别被他们抓住
You get in and get out. Don't get caught.

725
01:02:44,200 --> 01:02:45,890
抓住了你就等于抓住了我
You get caught, I get caught.

726
01:02:45,900 --> 01:02:47,560
知道这是什么?
You know what that is?

727
01:02:49,240 --> 01:02:52,070
他说没开枪杀人 可我怎么知道?
Says he didn't shoot no one, but I don't know.

728
01:02:52,105 --> 01:02:53,435
他和我在一起
Well, he's been staying with me.

729
01:02:53,470 --> 01:02:55,630
谁和你在一起? 鲍·李·史瓦格?
Who's been staying with you? Bob Lee Swagger?

730
01:03:04,250 --> 01:03:08,340
车子的牌照或许是假的 但这号码肯定是真的
The plates are probably fake. Pretty sure the other number's real.

731
01:03:08,360 --> 01:03:10,050
- 这是什么? - 车辆识别码
- And what is this? - A VIN number.

732
01:03:10,060 --> 01:03:13,390
谁也不会闲着没事去改它
Seems no one goes through the trouble to change them anymore.

733
01:03:14,530 --> 01:03:17,530
你要老老实实坐在这 等我走远了再离开
And you're going to sit real still until I'm long gone.

734
01:03:49,060 --> 01:03:50,360
看到那个穿飞鹰夹克的人了吗?
See the guy in the Eagles jacket?

735
01:04:15,960 --> 01:04:17,960
对不起先生 请你出示你到身份证
Excuse me, sir. Can I see some ID, please?

736
01:04:25,100 --> 01:04:27,530
先生请摘下你的帽子
Sir, I'm going to need you to take off your hat

737
01:04:27,565 --> 01:04:28,790
出示你的身份证
and show me some ID.

738
01:04:32,810 --> 01:04:34,500
请你按照我的要求做
I'm not gonna ask you again.

739
01:04:35,810 --> 01:04:37,670
摘下帽子 混蛋
Take your hat off, asshole!

740
01:04:46,690 --> 01:04:49,620
趴在地上!趴在地上!
Get on the ground! Get your ass on the ground!

741
01:05:22,860 --> 01:05:24,180
嘿 近来还好吗
Hey, how's it going?

742
01:05:25,990 --> 01:05:27,290
嘿 约翰
Hey, John.

743
01:05:29,750 --> 01:05:30,740
未经许可 禁止入内

744
01:05:45,740 --> 01:05:46,730
共有1个文档符合此号码

745
01:05:50,520 --> 01:05:51,810
- 喂 艾德 - 嗯
- Hey, Ed? - Yeah.

746
01:05:51,820 --> 01:05:53,784
你拿了斯蒂芬的文件吗? 我要拿回
You got that Stevens file we wanted back?

747
01:05:53,785 --> 01:05:55,090
被隔离信息 需要Delta级别通行证

748
01:05:56,220 --> 01:05:59,490
你真的这么想知道? 可能会被开除的
How badly do you want to know? Because this will get you fired.

749
01:05:59,730 --> 01:06:05,530
我就要去人士监管部…
Well, I have to go before the Office of Professional Responsibility

750
01:06:05,565 --> 01:06:07,620
再过四十五分钟我就要 接受审核调查了
in 45 minutes for a review.

751
01:06:07,630 --> 01:06:10,760
反正我都会被开除的 我豁出去了
I'm gonna get fired anyway. I'm done worrying about that.

752
01:06:11,870 --> 01:06:13,940
你认为呢?
What do you think?

753
01:06:14,540 --> 01:06:17,080
我认为 CNN在 我们之前 搞到了录像带
I think that CNN got the tapes before we did,

754
01:06:17,115 --> 01:06:19,510
通过剪辑来展现射击角度
already edited together to show the angles.

755
01:06:19,545 --> 01:06:20,675
谁交给他们的?
Who delivered them?

756
01:06:20,710 --> 01:06:24,220
是一个始终保持沉默的 秘密机构干的
An unnamed agency who will never confirm or deny.

757
01:06:24,255 --> 01:06:26,290
这一次他们否认 实际上…
They denied, which is a...

758
01:06:28,790 --> 01:06:32,050
就等于他们已经承认了
Which is a confirmation of sorts.

759
01:06:32,060 --> 01:06:33,955
承认什么?
Of what?

760
01:06:33,990 --> 01:06:37,620
你的问题已经超过了 自己应该知道的范围了
That you are asking questions way outside your pay grade.

761
01:06:37,630 --> 01:06:38,860
别这样 快告诉我
Oh, come on, just tell me.

762
01:06:38,870 --> 01:06:40,460
你不会想接受他们调查的
You don't want to be here for that review.

763
01:06:40,470 --> 01:06:44,130
他们不仅可以开除你 还可以起诉你拘留你
They don't have to stop at firing you. They can charge you and hold you.

764
01:06:52,880 --> 01:06:56,710
助理特别主管有第三级通行证
The ASAC's job comes with Delta clearance.

765
01:06:59,650 --> 01:07:01,050
谢谢 快走
- Thank you. - Go.

766
01:07:08,130 --> 01:07:10,220
这是一个网络的聊天记录
This is a copy of a chat room transcript.

767
01:07:10,230 --> 01:07:13,420
他们无所不谈 开始我并没有太在意
These guys talk about everything. I didn't give it much thought at the time.

768
01:07:13,430 --> 01:07:15,965
我们利用 WiFi 网络 跟踪到一家甜品店
We just traced it to a donut shop with free WiFi.

769
01:07:16,000 --> 01:07:21,770
这是七分钟之前费城 FBI 分局 提出的第三级通行证申请
But this,this is a Delta-level clearance request out of the FBI field office in Philadelphia seven minutes ago.

770
01:07:21,780 --> 01:07:24,470
谷歌地图显示那家甜品店…
Funny thing, Google Maps puts the donut shop

771
01:07:24,480 --> 01:07:27,100
就在费城分局的三个街区外
only three blocks away from the field office.

772
01:07:27,110 --> 01:07:30,270
史瓦格消失以前只有一个人见过他
There's only one guy who met with Swagger before he disappeared.

773
01:07:30,280 --> 01:07:31,580
他住在费城
He lives in Philly.

774
01:07:31,720 --> 01:07:33,250
为 FBI 工作
And he works for the FBI.

775
01:07:34,460 --> 01:07:35,890
尼古拉斯·孟菲斯
Nicholas Memphis.

776
01:07:36,220 --> 01:07:39,780
那是一家很奇怪的公司 跟许多大企业有生意往来
...really strange company. Contracts with a lot of the Fortune 500.

777
01:07:39,790 --> 01:07:42,730
把基地设在佛吉尼亚和德拉瓦 注册地在巴拿马
Offices in Virginia, Delaware, registered in Panama.

778
01:07:42,765 --> 01:07:44,630
他们有条船悬挂利比亚国旗
They own a boat that's flagged out of Libya.

779
01:07:44,665 --> 01:07:45,720
他们绝对不是政府机构
They're definitely not government,

780
01:07:45,730 --> 01:07:48,560
但有军方背景
but they have high ex-military contacts like you wouldn't believe.

781
01:07:48,570 --> 01:07:49,860
他们是承包商
These are contractors.

782
01:07:49,870 --> 01:07:52,460
我也不能告诉你 这公司是做什么的 但…
I can't tell what this company does, but...

783
01:07:54,240 --> 01:07:55,330
嘿
Hey.

784
01:07:55,340 --> 01:07:56,410
嘿 嘿 嘿!
Hey, hey, hey!

785
01:08:01,320 --> 01:08:02,485
孟菲斯?
Memphis?

786
01:08:02,520 --> 01:08:03,650
孟菲斯!
Memphis!

787
01:08:10,790 --> 01:08:12,725
这家伙什么也不知道
For a man who didn't know much,

788
01:08:12,760 --> 01:08:16,160
没必要再折磨下去
you sure took a long, painful time to tell it.

789
01:08:16,195 --> 01:08:17,860
给他灌点水
Get him some water.

790
01:08:26,910 --> 01:08:28,070
好
Good.

791
01:08:38,520 --> 01:08:39,815
想撒尿了没?
Got to pee yet?

792
01:08:39,850 --> 01:08:41,785
把胃里的药物排泄干净
Got to flush them drugs out of your system.

793
01:08:41,820 --> 01:08:44,220
免得你自杀的后引起怀疑
Look awful suspicious if you were to go and shoot yourself

794
01:08:44,255 --> 01:08:46,590
我们这里吃的都是一种药
pumped full of the same shit the agency uses.

795
01:08:46,625 --> 01:08:48,630
我不会自杀的!
I'm not going to shoot myself.

796
01:08:49,360 --> 01:08:50,560
你会的
Sure you will.

797
01:08:51,500 --> 01:08:53,030
带他过去 准备好
Take him out. Get him ready.

798
01:08:53,165 --> 01:08:54,200
不!
No!

799
01:08:59,840 --> 01:09:01,070
那是我的枪
That's my gun.

800
01:09:01,105 --> 01:09:02,200
是的
Yeah.

801
01:09:02,640 --> 01:09:05,125
你还写了份感人的遗书
You wrote a real touching suicide note, too.

802
01:09:05,160 --> 01:09:07,610
写满了你对错误的悔恨
All overwrought with guilt about your mistakes.

803
01:09:14,590 --> 01:09:16,210
挣扎也没用
Quit your struggling.

804
01:09:19,730 --> 01:09:23,630
这办法很有效 我们不是第一次用了
This thing works. It's not the first time we've used it.

805
01:09:28,040 --> 01:09:29,830
罗素!罗素!
Russo. Russo!

806
01:09:29,840 --> 01:09:31,560
戴维斯快来!
Davis, get out here!

807
01:09:36,310 --> 01:09:38,540
我说你们还在磨蹭什么?
What is the goddamn hold-up?

808
01:10:16,020 --> 01:10:19,350
请不要杀我! 请不要杀我!我相信你!
Don't kill me, please! Don't kill me! I believe you!

809
01:10:19,385 --> 01:10:20,540
杀你?
Kill you?

810
01:10:20,550 --> 01:10:23,280
要杀我早杀了
Had enough chances. I wanted you dead, you'd be dead.

811
01:10:24,420 --> 01:10:27,320
哪个混蛋发明了这玩意?
What kind of asshole'd think up a thing like this?

812
01:10:35,470 --> 01:10:38,800
这个小口径步枪和 简易消声器还挺好用嘛
Not bad with a poodle shooter and a makeshift silencer, huh?

813
01:10:40,010 --> 01:10:42,230
帮我把他们扔到水里
Help me toss these boys in the water?

814
01:10:42,240 --> 01:10:44,605
原来是你设的圈套!
You set me up and you used me as bait!

815
01:10:44,640 --> 01:10:47,580
是的 但他们真的就照做了
You think? Flushed them out, didn't it?

816
01:10:47,615 --> 01:10:48,710
我本来想留个活口
I was kind of hoping to keep one alive,

817
01:10:48,720 --> 01:10:50,910
但他们真的想杀你
but they were kind of determined to kill you.

818
01:10:50,920 --> 01:10:53,250
你可以请个好律师 我给局里打电话
You can hire a good lawyer, and I'll call the Bureau.

819
01:10:53,285 --> 01:10:55,290
可以和他们协商
They can work out some kind of deal.

820
01:10:56,160 --> 01:10:59,120
你可以向他们证明主教不是你杀的
This is explainable. You can prove that you didn't shoot the Archbishop.

821
01:10:59,130 --> 01:11:00,350
看来你还是不明白
I don't think you understand.

822
01:11:00,360 --> 01:11:01,650
那些人杀了我的狗
These boys killed my dog.

823
01:11:04,460 --> 01:11:07,500
现在是二十一世纪 你不可以跟他们这样硬拼
Hey, this is the 21st century. You can't go to war with these people.

824
01:11:07,535 --> 01:11:09,160
最终还是要法律…
In the end, the law is all...

825
01:11:09,170 --> 01:11:11,270
法律绝对不会把他们怎么样
In the end, the law'll never catch and hold them.

826
01:11:11,305 --> 01:11:13,652
不出一两年 他们就会重操旧业
In a year or two, they'll be back in business.

827
01:11:13,687 --> 01:11:16,000
改头换面 继续做恶 重振旗鼓
New names, new messenger boys, same old story.

828
01:11:16,140 --> 01:11:17,400
只有我会死
And I'll be dead.

829
01:11:17,410 --> 01:11:19,440
所以我还要想出一条活路
It's gonna be some hard, hairy work, Pork.

830
01:11:19,450 --> 01:11:21,640
血还要流 人还会死
There's gonna be more shooting, and more people are gonna die.

831
01:11:21,650 --> 01:11:24,980
我别无选择只能把这件事做到底
Now, I didn't start it, but be sure as hell I mean to see it through.

832
01:11:24,990 --> 01:11:27,580
只说你是合作还是不合作?
So you get it straight. You in or you out?

833
01:11:30,760 --> 01:11:32,220
我今天没赶上一个会议
You know, I missed a meeting today

834
01:11:32,230 --> 01:11:35,780
在那个会议上我会被开除
where I was going to get fired for unprofessional conduct

835
01:11:35,800 --> 01:11:38,890
因为遭到了这群不存在的人绑架
because I was kidnapped by people that don't exist.

836
01:11:43,440 --> 01:11:44,905
我抬他的腿
I'll take his legs.

837
01:11:44,940 --> 01:11:46,700
这就对了 菜鸟
It's a good call, Pork.

838
01:11:47,170 --> 01:11:50,070
你想说一个 FBI 菜鸟特工
You're trying to tell me a rookie FBI agent

839
01:11:50,080 --> 01:11:51,970
杀了他们三个?
overpowered and killed the three of them?

840
01:11:51,980 --> 01:11:53,050
不
No.

841
01:11:53,680 --> 01:11:57,680
他们是被人从两百码外开枪打死的
They were shot from a distance of about 200 yards.

842
01:11:59,450 --> 01:12:00,810
用点二二口径的步枪
With a.22.

843
01:12:02,690 --> 01:12:05,020
- 史瓦格还活着 - 是的
- Swagger's alive. - Yes.

844
01:12:05,030 --> 01:12:08,380
那个年轻的 FBI 特工
And that young kid,FBI Agent

845
01:12:10,760 --> 01:12:12,060
尼克·孟菲斯
Nick Memphis,

846
01:12:12,070 --> 01:12:15,935
他已经设法窃取了第三级通行证
who managed to pry out a Delta-level clearance,

847
01:12:15,970 --> 01:12:19,800
他没有返回局里 目前还和史瓦格呆在一起
hasn't come back to the office and is out there with him.

848
01:12:21,880 --> 01:12:22,905
怎么样?
What?

849
01:12:22,940 --> 01:12:25,200
我刚查了史瓦格的信用卡
I just went over Swagger's financials again.

850
01:12:25,580 --> 01:12:29,274
他每年定期一次给某人寄鲜花
Once a year, he sent flowers to someone with his Visa card.

851
01:12:29,275 --> 01:12:30,780
我侵入了FTD的数据库 找到了地址
I cracked the FTD database, got an address.

852
01:12:31,950 --> 01:12:35,220
是在唐尼·佛恩的祭日 寄给他的遗孀
Donnie Fenrs widow. Anniversary of his death.

853
01:12:35,255 --> 01:12:37,052
这个女人又该用了以前的姓
She went back to using her maiden name,

854
01:12:37,087 --> 01:12:38,850
所以当初调查的时候给漏掉了
which is why we missed it the first time.

855
01:12:39,930 --> 01:12:41,790
估计她是世界上唯一一个
She's maybe the only person in the entire world

856
01:12:41,800 --> 01:12:43,950
对史瓦格言听计从的人了
that would believe anything that Swagger had to say.

857
01:12:43,960 --> 01:12:46,595
你看 肯塔基州基恩市
Look. Keene City, Kentucky.

858
01:12:46,630 --> 01:12:49,230
开车一会就到
It's just within driving range.

859
01:12:50,100 --> 01:12:52,900
- 开车太慢了 我们坐飞机去 - 好
- What are you waiting for? Take the jet. - All right.

860
01:13:00,580 --> 01:13:02,380
这是和史瓦格的战争
We've given Swagger a new war,

861
01:13:02,720 --> 01:13:04,280
他又有了观察员
he's found a new spotter.

862
01:13:05,550 --> 01:13:07,280
事情变得非常难办了
This is about to get worse.

863
01:13:07,420 --> 01:13:09,970
田纳西州 雅典市

864
01:13:36,280 --> 01:13:38,010
好像到了
I think we're here.

865
01:13:39,050 --> 01:13:40,380
史瓦格
Hey. Swagger.

866
01:13:44,690 --> 01:13:46,220
我们到了
I think we're here.

867
01:13:49,230 --> 01:13:51,425
欢迎回到田纳西
Welcome to Tennessee.

868
01:13:51,460 --> 01:13:53,690
这里可是枪战之乡
Patron state of shooting stuff.

869
01:13:55,870 --> 01:13:57,365
那个人是谁?
Hey, who is this guy?

870
01:13:57,400 --> 01:14:01,030
他是密西西比的传奇人物
This guy was the greatest gunsmith east of the Mississippi. He's a legend.

871
01:14:02,380 --> 01:14:03,540
比史密斯威森枪厂知道得还多
He knows more about guns and the people who shoot them than Smith & Wesson.

872
01:14:04,380 --> 01:14:06,970
不过别担心 他要杀我们三英里外就动手了
Don't really matter anymore. He knew we were coming the last three miles.

873
01:14:06,980 --> 01:14:08,240
- 注意礼貌 - 好的
- You mind your manners. - All right.

874
01:14:08,250 --> 01:14:11,940
两位远道而来 想找什么?
You boys come a long way. What you looking for?

875
01:14:12,150 --> 01:14:13,340
智慧
Wisdom.

876
01:14:15,290 --> 01:14:17,020
你们可能找错了地方
You come to the wrong place.

877
01:14:17,055 --> 01:14:18,355
可能吧
Maybe.

878
01:14:18,390 --> 01:14:20,080
如果有人想用步枪射出的子弹
Say a man wanted to fire a bullet from one rifle

879
01:14:20,090 --> 01:14:21,850
和另外一支枪的子弹完全相同
and have it match exactly to another.

880
01:14:21,860 --> 01:14:23,330
能做到吗?
Could that be done?

881
01:14:23,365 --> 01:14:24,450
坐
Take a seat.

882
01:14:25,230 --> 01:14:26,560
请坐 先生
Have a chair, son.

883
01:14:30,740 --> 01:14:34,800
如果你能使步枪的 子弹射出没有留下痕迹
If you could get a bullet that had been shot clean through the first rifle,

884
01:14:34,810 --> 01:14:36,400
就可以在上面伪造槽纹
could make the grooves match.

885
01:14:36,410 --> 01:14:38,840
很久都没人这么做了
Kind of thing ain't been done in a long time, though.

886
01:14:38,850 --> 01:14:40,470
从大主教身上取下的子弹
The bullet that was taken out of the Archbishop

887
01:14:40,480 --> 01:14:42,140
已经严重变形
was completely mangled on impact.

888
01:14:42,150 --> 01:14:44,480
FBI 只能做材质鉴别
FBI match was metallurgical.

889
01:14:44,515 --> 01:14:45,740
谢谢 老太婆
Thank you, Mother.

890
01:14:45,750 --> 01:14:48,250
但是那也不能保证万无一失 所以他们必须格外慎重
Yeah, but you couldn't guarantee that going in, so they had to be sure.

891
01:14:48,285 --> 01:14:50,850
很难想象他们能够做到
And I still can't figure out how they could be.

892
01:14:53,690 --> 01:14:55,350
- 味道不错? - 是阿
- Good coffee? - Yep.

893
01:14:57,260 --> 01:15:00,530
在左边的书架上找找看 上数第二层
Look on your left, there. Second shelf down.

894
01:15:01,330 --> 01:15:03,630
红色封皮的那本
Red leather spine.

895
01:15:03,740 --> 01:15:06,700
作者的名字叫史高飞
Written by a guy named Schofeld.

896
01:15:07,840 --> 01:15:11,780
我把它放在那里十五年了 没想到还用的上
Put it there 15 years ago. Don't figure it's moved since then.

897
01:15:26,760 --> 01:15:28,380
第四章 改变子弹以达到不同效果　第一节 裹纸法

898
01:15:31,360 --> 01:15:33,690
这里 裹纸法
Yeah. Paper patching.

899
01:15:33,700 --> 01:15:36,960
始于一八七零年非洲的最新技术
State of the art. 1870s Africa.

900
01:15:36,970 --> 01:15:38,265
用纸包裹子弹
Paper-wrapped bullet.

901
01:15:38,300 --> 01:15:40,930
弹头不会和枪管直接接触
No metal on metal going down the barrel.

902
01:15:40,940 --> 01:15:44,070
槽纹就能匹配 纸会在子弹飞出枪口时脱落
Grooves would match. Paper unwinds at the muzzle.

903
01:15:44,080 --> 01:15:46,200
子弹不会留下任何痕迹
Leaves no traces when it hits.

904
01:15:46,210 --> 01:15:49,940
你们的问题很有趣 希望你们满意
Interesting question, though. Hope I satisfied you.

905
01:15:49,950 --> 01:15:51,350
我还有个问题
I got another one.

906
01:15:51,990 --> 01:15:53,110
不出我所料
I thought you might.

907
01:15:53,120 --> 01:15:56,210
假如我寻找一个能在 两千两百码外命中目标的人
Suppose I was looking for a man to make a 2,200-yard cold-bore shot.

908
01:15:56,220 --> 01:15:58,020
有谁能办到?
Who's alive that could do that?

909
01:15:58,490 --> 01:16:02,720
听说有人不久前进行过那样的射击
Seems I heard about a shot like that being made not too long ago.

910
01:16:02,730 --> 01:16:05,960
据说那个人叫鲍·李·史瓦格
Said the guy's name was Bob Lee Swagger.

911
01:16:05,970 --> 01:16:08,290
我不认识他 所以无法证实
Never met the man, so I wouldn't know him.

912
01:16:08,300 --> 01:16:09,835
没错 他们是这么说的
Yeah, they said that, all right.

913
01:16:09,870 --> 01:16:13,670
我还听说人造糖精不会致癌
They also said that artificial sweeteners were safe,

914
01:16:14,570 --> 01:16:16,249
伊拉克有大规模杀伤武器
and WMDs were in Iraq,

915
01:16:16,250 --> 01:16:19,010
安娜·妮科尔为了爱情而结婚!
and Anna Nicole married for love!

916
01:16:21,850 --> 01:16:23,810
不过暗杀总归不是好事
Would've been a bad job to take, though.

917
01:16:23,820 --> 01:16:24,945
怎么讲?
How come?

918
01:16:24,980 --> 01:16:27,640
开枪的人恐怕自己也活不成
Whoever took that shot's probably dead now.

919
01:16:27,650 --> 01:16:28,689
阴谋诡计都是这样收场
That's how a conspiracy works.

920
01:16:28,690 --> 01:16:32,410
那些在"草丘"上的杀手也没活过3个小时
Them boys on the grassy knoll, they were dead within three hours.

921
01:16:37,430 --> 01:16:38,960
你说的这些是真的么?
And you know this for a fact?

922
01:16:38,970 --> 01:16:40,860
铁锹我还留着呢
Still got the shovel.

923
01:16:42,940 --> 01:16:44,870
假如不是那个人干的呢?
Sake of argument, somebody other than him?

924
01:16:44,905 --> 01:16:46,500
俄罗斯还有个人
There was a guy in Russia.

925
01:16:46,510 --> 01:16:48,370
还被关进了监狱
They locked his ass up.

926
01:16:48,980 --> 01:16:51,740
还有个在法国死掉了
Another one in France. I know he's dead.

927
01:16:52,550 --> 01:16:54,475
另外还有个…
There was one guy,

928
01:16:54,510 --> 01:16:56,880
可他早就金盆洗手了
but he don't shoot no more.

929
01:16:57,150 --> 01:17:00,010
那是个极端残忍的家伙
A brutal son of a bitch.

930
01:17:00,020 --> 01:17:03,250
其他人直接射杀 他先把人打伤
Most boys shoot to kill. He'd shoot to wound,

931
01:17:03,890 --> 01:17:05,690
然后等他的朋友来救他
wait till his friends come to help,

932
01:17:05,990 --> 01:17:07,250
一起杀掉
kill them too.

933
01:17:07,260 --> 01:17:09,520
一次就干掉了四个
Turned one target into four.

934
01:17:10,200 --> 01:17:14,030
男的 女的 儿童 杀过好几百人呢
Men, women, children. Killed them by the hundreds.

935
01:17:14,065 --> 01:17:16,365
他的对手急于要他的命
The other side wanted him. Bad.

936
01:17:16,400 --> 01:17:21,800
最后发现他在一栋废弃的六层楼里
Finally narrowed his hide down to an abandoned six-story building.

937
01:17:22,910 --> 01:17:25,290
那些人用来最极端的方法
They quit the subtle tactics.

938
01:17:25,325 --> 01:17:27,670
他们动用了炮火支援
They called in an artillery strike.

939
01:17:27,680 --> 01:17:29,645
整栋楼都没了
Leveled a square block.

940
01:17:29,680 --> 01:17:31,940
他被活活的埋在里面
Brought the building down on his ass.

941
01:17:31,950 --> 01:17:34,490
有人说他还是逃出去了
Some say he crawled out of there.

942
01:17:34,525 --> 01:17:36,285
有人说他死了
Some say he died.

943
01:17:36,320 --> 01:17:38,360
但没有人在提起他的消息
Never heard from him no more.

944
01:17:38,960 --> 01:17:40,620
见鬼
Fuck me.

945
01:17:40,630 --> 01:17:41,720
怎么?
What?

946
01:17:41,730 --> 01:17:43,260
我曾见过这个人
I met the son of a bitch.

947
01:17:47,630 --> 01:17:50,760
这个世界什么都可能发生 是吧 军士?
Yeah. The world ain't what it seems, is it, Gunnie?

948
01:17:51,640 --> 01:17:52,860
不 先生
No, sir.

949
01:17:52,870 --> 01:17:54,560
记住我的话
You keep that in mind.

950
01:17:54,570 --> 01:17:56,440
当你自以为明白的时候
The moment you think you got it figured,

951
01:17:56,510 --> 01:17:57,580
其实不然
you're wrong.

952
01:18:01,550 --> 01:18:02,710
他的名字?
He got a name?

953
01:18:08,120 --> 01:18:09,650
是我 尼克
Hey, it's me, Nick.

954
01:18:09,660 --> 01:18:12,690
你知道自己闯了多大的祸么?
Do you have any idea how much trouble you're in?

955
01:18:13,330 --> 01:18:15,420
知道 你还好吗?尼克 你在哪?
- Yeah. - Are you okay? Nick, where are you?

956
01:18:15,430 --> 01:18:16,760
你最好不要知道
It's better I don't tell you.

957
01:18:17,500 --> 01:18:19,960
有笔吗?
Look, do you have a pen?

958
01:18:19,970 --> 01:18:22,530
我要你帮我找一个人 叫米开罗·斯泽比亚克
I need you to find someone. Mikhaylo Sczerbiak.

959
01:18:22,540 --> 01:18:23,600
- 好的 - 你记下了么?
- Yeah. - You got it?

960
01:18:23,635 --> 01:18:24,690
已经记下了
I got it.

961
01:18:24,740 --> 01:18:26,670
这个名字好难拼啊
Man, this is hard to spell.

962
01:18:32,780 --> 01:18:36,040
史瓦格会想尽一切办法
Swagger is going to go with what he knows.

963
01:18:36,050 --> 01:18:38,410
去寻找那个开枪的人
He'll try to track the shooter.

964
01:18:38,420 --> 01:18:40,040
那只是一厢情愿
He won't get far that way.

965
01:18:40,050 --> 01:18:41,640
并非如此
Yes, he will.

966
01:18:41,650 --> 01:18:43,850
- 什么意思? - 我们会帮他找到你
- How's that? - We're going to help him.

967
01:18:43,860 --> 01:18:47,020
要抓狼就得放饵
Sometimes to catch a wolf, you need to tie the bait to a tree.

968
01:18:54,070 --> 01:18:55,860
那饵下场会怎样?
And what happens to the bait?

969
01:18:57,300 --> 01:18:58,770
很难讲
Hard to say.

970
01:18:59,670 --> 01:19:02,430
有时候牺牲总是难免的
But that's the nature of being the bait.

971
01:19:04,120 --> 01:19:06,220
(米开罗·斯泽比亚克)

972
01:19:15,390 --> 01:19:17,850
- 我是尼克 找到他了吗? - 他在弗吉尼亚州
- Hey, it's Nick. Did you find him? - He's in Virginia.

973
01:19:18,830 --> 01:19:21,020
我们原本以为搞定的事情
An end we thought was tied up

974
01:19:21,130 --> 01:19:22,320
又出岔子了
came untied.

975
01:19:23,160 --> 01:19:24,920
什么意思上校?
Meaning, Colonel?

976
01:19:24,930 --> 01:19:26,860
史瓦格还活着
Swagger is still alive.

977
01:19:30,200 --> 01:19:31,670
还活着
Oh, my.

978
01:19:32,210 --> 01:19:36,940
我现在需要一架海关免检的运输机
I need to land a transport plane without a customs check.

979
01:19:38,510 --> 01:19:42,210
我本不想打听 不过你要用它装什么?
I'm certain I don't want to know, but what's on the plane?

980
01:19:43,920 --> 01:19:45,780
我们用在埃塞俄比亚的人
Crew we used in Ethiopia.

981
01:19:45,790 --> 01:19:48,880
二十四名杀手
Twenty-four good, hard men.

982
01:19:48,890 --> 01:19:51,150
还有武器和装备
Weapons and gear.

983
01:19:51,160 --> 01:19:52,780
只有二十四名?
Only 24?

984
01:19:54,130 --> 01:19:55,630
必须除掉他
Do kill him.

985
01:19:57,260 --> 01:19:59,300
这次只许成功
No loose ends this time.

986
01:20:00,100 --> 01:20:01,600
晚安上校
Night, Colonel.

987
01:20:03,170 --> 01:20:04,260
晚安参议员
Good night, Senator.

988
01:20:23,020 --> 01:20:24,180
是谁?
Hello?

989
01:20:26,290 --> 01:20:27,790
有人么?
Someone there?

990
01:21:03,960 --> 01:21:05,190
看看
Now look.

991
01:21:05,800 --> 01:21:07,700
看看你都做了些什么
Look what you've done now.

992
01:21:10,870 --> 01:21:12,400
把枪给我
Give me that.

993
01:21:12,410 --> 01:21:15,500
我可不想让你伤着自己?
I don't want you to hurt yourself. Okay?

994
01:21:23,920 --> 01:21:25,850
你的男朋友呢?
Where's your boyfriend?

995
01:21:25,880 --> 01:21:27,070
弗吉尼亚州 林奇堡

996
01:21:27,990 --> 01:21:29,680
如果是陷阱怎么办?
What if it's a trap?

997
01:21:30,020 --> 01:21:31,455
就是陷阱
Oh, it's a trap.

998
01:21:31,490 --> 01:21:33,920
陷阱处处有
Guaranteed. Every time.

999
01:21:35,700 --> 01:21:37,490
问题是谁会掉进去?
Question is, for whom?

1000
01:21:38,900 --> 01:21:41,030
- 购物清单好了吗? - 是的
- You got your list, right? - Yep.

1001
01:21:41,065 --> 01:21:43,160
好了 记住别买错
All right, you make sure you stick to it.

1002
01:22:11,130 --> 01:22:12,200
走吧
Let's go.

1003
01:22:17,640 --> 01:22:19,760
这些到底是干什么用的?
Okay, so what are these for again?

1004
01:22:20,370 --> 01:22:22,170
催泪弹 由我来遥控
Tear gas is going to be on my remote.

1005
01:22:22,180 --> 01:22:23,830
好
Right.

1006
01:22:23,840 --> 01:22:28,145
凝固汽油弹用在一层 铁管炸弹 用来对付其他人
Napalm on the first floor. Pipe bombs on the rest of them.

1007
01:22:28,180 --> 01:22:32,310
这些东西要轻拿轻放 它的杀伤半径是十五英尺
Gotta be very careful with these. It's got a 15-foot kill radius.

1008
01:22:32,320 --> 01:22:34,580
我们这是要干什么?
So what exactly are we getting ready for?

1009
01:22:34,590 --> 01:22:36,120
要干的事可多了
For as much as we can be.

1010
01:22:49,170 --> 01:22:51,500
你现在面对四个敌人
All right, you got four enemy combatants.

1011
01:22:51,535 --> 01:22:53,330
把他们消灭
Take them one by one.

1012
01:22:53,340 --> 01:22:55,370
专心致致 别受环境的影响
Keep shooting. Don't let anything distract you.

1013
01:23:03,880 --> 01:23:05,040
见鬼!
Fuck!

1014
01:23:07,250 --> 01:23:09,830
不是说过别受环境影响吗?
Didrt I say don't let anything distract you?

1015
01:23:09,865 --> 01:23:12,410
慢就是稳 稳就是快 再来
Slow is smooth, smooth is fast. Let's see it.

1016
01:23:28,410 --> 01:23:30,030
不 不
No. No.

1017
01:23:30,480 --> 01:23:32,410
这就我们两个 宝贝
It's just you and me, baby.

1018
01:23:32,445 --> 01:23:33,570
不!
No!

1019
01:23:36,550 --> 01:23:38,120
一共有三名警卫
You got three guards.

1020
01:23:38,920 --> 01:23:40,450
一个在两点钟方向
One at your 2:00,

1021
01:23:41,750 --> 01:23:42,950
一个在十二点钟
12:00

1022
01:23:44,220 --> 01:23:45,450
一个在十点钟
and 10:00.

1023
01:23:53,970 --> 01:23:55,090
两点方向有人靠近
Danger close. 2:00,

1024
01:23:55,100 --> 01:23:56,170
就离你五十码
fifty yards.

1025
01:24:59,700 --> 01:25:00,860
一个在你正上方
You got one right on you.

1026
01:25:01,200 --> 01:25:02,270
距离二十码 正在向你靠近
20 yards and closing.

1027
01:25:52,890 --> 01:25:54,380
去看看周围的情况
Go check the perimeter.

1028
01:25:54,720 --> 01:25:56,340
告诉大家保持警惕
And tell the others to stay alert.

1029
01:25:56,360 --> 01:25:58,180
是 长官
I'm on it. Right away, sir.

1030
01:26:32,260 --> 01:26:33,850
史瓦格 屋顶还有一个
Swagger, you got one above you on the roof.

1031
01:26:52,480 --> 01:26:53,880
三个都干掉了?
You killed all three?

1032
01:26:54,710 --> 01:26:56,150
连你四个
There were four.

1033
01:26:56,980 --> 01:27:00,540
告诉我约翰逊的真名 我要知道他为谁工作
I want Johnsors real name. I want to know who he works for.

1034
01:27:00,550 --> 01:27:02,520
为什么要大动干戈
I want to know why it was won'th going through that much effort

1035
01:27:02,555 --> 01:27:04,050
杀掉大主教?
to kill the Archbishop.

1036
01:27:04,890 --> 01:27:06,480
是你杀的吗?
Arert you the one that shot him?

1037
01:27:06,490 --> 01:27:08,650
如果我什么都不知道呢?
And if I don't know any of those things?

1038
01:27:08,660 --> 01:27:09,850
那就没必要留着你了
Then you're of no won'th to me

1039
01:27:09,860 --> 01:27:12,120
我会杀掉你 然后走掉
and I might as well shoot you now and leave.

1040
01:27:16,240 --> 01:27:18,705
约翰逊有很多名字
Johnsors had a lot of names.

1041
01:27:18,740 --> 01:27:22,600
我不知道到的那一个是真的
Don't know one's any more real than the next.

1042
01:27:22,610 --> 01:27:24,440
知道会很危险的
Knowing would only be dangerous.

1043
01:27:26,010 --> 01:27:27,640
他当过陆军
He's ex-army.

1044
01:27:27,650 --> 01:27:30,180
可以肯定他得过上校军衔
Pretty sure he was a full-bird colonel.

1045
01:27:33,390 --> 01:27:34,580
说下去
Go on.

1046
01:27:36,320 --> 01:27:39,190
他们找到我就像找到你一样
They came for me, like they came for you.

1047
01:27:40,260 --> 01:27:42,760
让我执行一次性任务
Recruitment for a single job.

1048
01:27:44,360 --> 01:27:45,900
他们喜欢这样做
They like the wounded.

1049
01:27:46,900 --> 01:27:48,660
用起来顺手
Easier to use

1050
01:27:49,600 --> 01:27:51,670
用完了就可以丢掉 没人管
and then throw away when you are done.

1051
01:27:52,970 --> 01:27:55,060
提蒙斯 你 我
Timmons, you, me...

1052
01:27:57,610 --> 01:28:02,650
人一旦变成狼就很难再 听人吩咐 任人宰割
Once you've been a wolf, it's hard to be staked down like a goat.

1053
01:28:03,650 --> 01:28:08,520
我们两个死到临头的人 完全可以开诚布公了
This is just one dead man talking to another.

1054
01:28:09,490 --> 01:28:10,920
大主教怎么回事?
And the Archbishop?

1055
01:28:12,460 --> 01:28:16,390
你想杀人灭口又不引起怀疑么?
You want to take all suspicions away when you shoot someone,

1056
01:28:16,560 --> 01:28:19,060
那就等他站在总统身边再下手
wait till he's standing next to the President.

1057
01:28:20,400 --> 01:28:21,930
大主教想干什么?
What was he going to say?

1058
01:28:22,870 --> 01:28:24,265
揭露真相
The truth.

1059
01:28:24,300 --> 01:28:27,960
这种事情无论多么恐怖
That nothing, no matter how horrible,

1060
01:28:27,970 --> 01:28:31,570
要是没有政府点头是很难办到得
ever really happens without the approval of the government.

1061
01:28:31,580 --> 01:28:33,670
国内国外都是如此
Over there, and here.

1062
01:28:35,680 --> 01:28:37,580
问题不在于干了什么
The problem isn't the doing.

1063
01:28:38,980 --> 01:28:41,180
在于让当权者承认
It's the people in power having to admit

1064
01:28:41,550 --> 01:28:42,750
他们知情
that they knew.

1065
01:28:44,420 --> 01:28:47,320
阿布格莱布监狱得囚犯受到虐待
The prisoners are tortured at Abu Ghraib,

1066
01:28:47,330 --> 01:28:49,590
只有普通士兵受到处罚
and only the underlings go to jail.

1067
01:28:50,230 --> 01:28:51,920
当官的完全知情
Their bosses knew.

1068
01:28:51,930 --> 01:28:54,160
我们知道他们知情
We know their bosses knew.

1069
01:28:54,170 --> 01:28:55,490
但谁也不说
But you don't say it.

1070
01:28:55,500 --> 01:28:57,330
非洲到底发生了什么事?
What exactly happened in Africa?

1071
01:28:57,340 --> 01:28:59,930
那些村民怎么也不相信
Somehow the villagers didn't think

1072
01:29:00,070 --> 01:29:02,070
仅仅为了一条输油管道
that an oil pipeline

1073
01:29:02,580 --> 01:29:05,405
就可以让他们背井离乡
was a good enough reason to move their village

1074
01:29:05,440 --> 01:29:08,980
搬到一个没有圣灵保佑的地方
to a place where the spirit gods didn't exist.

1075
01:29:09,015 --> 01:29:10,015
喝点?
Drink?

1076
01:29:10,050 --> 01:29:11,210
就是说他们先劝说
So they asked them all nicely to move

1077
01:29:11,220 --> 01:29:12,680
如果不从就杀掉?
and when they didn't, they just killed them all?

1078
01:29:12,690 --> 01:29:13,750
不
No.

1079
01:29:13,890 --> 01:29:15,210
根本不劝
They didn't ask.

1080
01:29:15,490 --> 01:29:16,950
直接杀掉
They just killed them.

1081
01:29:16,960 --> 01:29:18,020
全部杀掉
AII.

1082
01:29:18,190 --> 01:29:21,260
于是其他村子就更不用劝了
So the next village won't need to be asked.

1083
01:29:21,295 --> 01:29:22,690
都会听话的搬走
They'll just go.

1084
01:29:34,410 --> 01:29:38,740
在一个大坑里埋了四百多具尸体
There is a mass grave with 400 bodies,

1085
01:29:38,775 --> 01:29:42,540
男人 女人 还有孩子…
men, women, children,

1086
01:29:42,550 --> 01:29:47,280
就在厄立特里亚边境十公里远的 一个输油站下面
under the oil pumping station 10 kilometers over the Eritrean border.

1087
01:29:48,950 --> 01:29:50,455
你应该知道
You should know.

1088
01:29:50,490 --> 01:29:54,620
正是你们保卫的那些 承包商杀害了他们
You covered the retreat of the contractors who did the job.

1089
01:29:55,900 --> 01:29:58,760
当然 本来你也不该活着回来的
Of course, you werert supposed to survive that, either.

1090
01:30:07,810 --> 01:30:09,035
约翰逊受谁指使?
Who runs Johnson?

1091
01:30:09,070 --> 01:30:11,570
一名议员 好像是蒙大拿州的
A senator. From Montana, I think.

1092
01:30:13,050 --> 01:30:14,770
你不明白
You don't get it.

1093
01:30:15,110 --> 01:30:17,310
你根本找不到罪魁祸首
There is no head to cut off.

1094
01:30:18,380 --> 01:30:20,280
他们是一个利益共同体
It's a conglomerate.

1095
01:30:20,820 --> 01:30:23,680
如果其中有谁背叛了
If one of them betrays the principles

1096
01:30:25,090 --> 01:30:27,420
财富积累的原则
of the accrual of money and power,

1097
01:30:28,430 --> 01:30:30,220
他就会被抛弃
the others betray him.

1098
01:30:31,230 --> 01:30:37,430
这是人的贪婪本性所决定的
What it is...is human weakness.

1099
01:30:38,700 --> 01:30:41,710
是无法用枪除掉的
You can't kill that with a gun.

1100
01:30:49,520 --> 01:30:50,595
史瓦格
Swagger.

1101
01:30:50,630 --> 01:30:51,670
史瓦格
Swagger.

1102
01:30:51,680 --> 01:30:54,580
你必须马上离开 到处都是他们的人
You got to get out of there. They're everywhere.

1103
01:30:55,290 --> 01:30:58,480
我必须留住你等他们赶到
Had to keep you till they got here.

1104
01:30:59,860 --> 01:31:03,260
谎话是留不住你的
Lying wasrt going to hold you.

1105
01:31:03,930 --> 01:31:05,590
你马上会识破
You would have known.

1106
01:31:10,470 --> 01:31:13,870
顺带一提 你的女人在他们的手里
By the way, they've got your woman.

1107
01:31:16,840 --> 01:31:18,000
史瓦格
Swagger.

1108
01:31:18,010 --> 01:31:21,570
他们离你只有二十码了 你必须马上出来
They're 20 yards and closing. You got to get out of there.

1109
01:31:23,250 --> 01:31:25,250
- 快去第二隐蔽处 - 明白
- Bug out. Go to hide two. - Roger that.

1110
01:31:57,220 --> 01:31:58,980
史瓦格 我到了第二隐蔽处
Swagger, I'm in position two.

1111
01:31:59,790 --> 01:32:01,010
你必须马上离开
You got to get out of there.

1112
01:32:01,020 --> 01:32:02,590
- 到处都是他们的人 - 嘿
- They're all over the place. - Hey!

1113
01:32:03,090 --> 01:32:04,555
冷静点
Calm down.

1114
01:32:04,590 --> 01:32:07,180
听我命令 引爆外面的铁管炸弹
Blow the pipe bombs outside on my call, okay? You got it?

1115
01:32:07,390 --> 01:32:09,290
我明白
Yeah, yeah. Yeah, I got it.

1116
01:32:16,770 --> 01:32:17,840
听好了
Listen very carefully.

1117
01:32:17,900 --> 01:32:19,630
我数到一 先引爆铁管炸弹
On my one, you blow the pipe bombs,

1118
01:32:19,640 --> 01:32:20,710
然后汽油弹
then the gas.

1119
01:32:21,640 --> 01:32:23,500
三 二 一
Three, two, one...

1120
01:32:53,310 --> 01:32:54,530
引爆汽油弹!
Hit it. Hit the napalm.

1121
01:33:49,560 --> 01:33:50,650
史瓦格!
Swagger!

1122
01:33:57,800 --> 01:33:59,200
你一定行的
You got it.

1123
01:34:10,450 --> 01:34:11,710
史瓦格!
Swagger!

1124
01:34:14,020 --> 01:34:15,680
史瓦格!
Swagger!

1125
01:34:16,290 --> 01:34:17,720
史瓦格!
Swagger!

1126
01:34:24,230 --> 01:34:26,190
听我的命令 躲到后面谷仓去
You got to bug out on my go behind that barn.

1127
01:34:26,200 --> 01:34:27,235
好的
Okay.

1128
01:34:27,270 --> 01:34:28,420
- 准备好了? - 是的
- You ready? - Yeah.

1129
01:34:28,430 --> 01:34:29,560
走!
Go!

1130
01:34:32,940 --> 01:34:34,010
快走
Come on!

1131
01:35:02,330 --> 01:35:03,700
我们得躲到树林那边去
You got to gun it to that tree line.

1132
01:35:03,900 --> 01:35:04,970
什么?
What?

1133
01:35:05,040 --> 01:35:07,000
还有五发子弹把那鸟引过来
You got five shots left. Gotta draw that bird out.

1134
01:35:07,010 --> 01:35:08,040
好的
Okay. Okay.

1135
01:35:08,340 --> 01:35:10,310
- 我来掩护你 - 好的
- On my cover, all right? - Okay.

1136
01:35:11,980 --> 01:35:13,070
好的!行动
All right, go!

1137
01:35:26,390 --> 01:35:27,980
拉高!拉高!
Pull up! Pull up!

1138
01:35:43,940 --> 01:35:45,030
是时候走了
Time to go!

1139
01:36:02,830 --> 01:36:03,860
让我看看
Let me take a look.

1140
01:36:04,200 --> 01:36:05,260
现在不行
Not right now.

1141
01:36:05,760 --> 01:36:07,160
早上好 美人
Morning, beautiful.

1142
01:36:07,470 --> 01:36:09,565
- 看到佛州枪战了吗? - 长官?
- See this weird shootout in Virginia? - Sir...

1143
01:36:09,600 --> 01:36:14,040
弹痕累累 到处是直升机残骸 和血迹 但就是没有尸体
Shells everywhere, helicopter remnants, blood. No bodies, though, right?

1144
01:36:14,075 --> 01:36:17,770
他们提取了两组留在弹壳上得指纹
And they get fingerprints off the can'tridge cases.

1145
01:36:17,780 --> 01:36:21,110
第一组毫无疑问是 鲍·李·史瓦格的
First set positively IDed as Bob Lee Swagger.

1146
01:36:22,810 --> 01:36:28,220
第二组是 FBI 特工 尼克·孟菲斯的
Second set belongs to Special Agent Nick Memphis of the FBI.

1147
01:36:28,420 --> 01:36:30,040
也许搞错了
What? That's gotta be wrong.

1148
01:36:33,290 --> 01:36:36,850
对此我只想问一点…
Now, the only reasonable question to ask after that is,

1149
01:36:39,130 --> 01:36:40,460
这他妈的到底是怎么回事?
what the fuck is going on?

1150
01:36:46,370 --> 01:36:47,800
好枪法
Great shot!

1151
01:36:51,240 --> 01:36:53,870
- 轮到你了 丹 - 好枪法
- All yours, Dan! - Good shooting!

1152
01:36:53,880 --> 01:36:57,240
我开始觉得你不适合这份工作了
I'm beginning to think that you were the wrong man for the job.

1153
01:36:58,750 --> 01:37:00,320
随你怎么想好了
Think what you want.

1154
01:37:02,750 --> 01:37:06,810
我们显然低估了那个枪炮军士
It appears we misjudged the gunnery sergeant.

1155
01:37:08,530 --> 01:37:10,620
总有个神经错乱的人
There's always a confused soul

1156
01:37:10,630 --> 01:37:13,320
想要改变世界
that thinks that one man can make a difference.

1157
01:37:14,400 --> 01:37:17,630
你必须要把他干掉 才能改变他的想法
And you have to kill him to convince him otherwise.

1158
01:37:19,870 --> 01:37:21,940
这就是民主带来的麻烦
That's the hassle with democracy.

1159
01:37:22,340 --> 01:37:23,470
发射
Pull!

1160
01:37:25,950 --> 01:37:28,170
蒙大拿州 波兹曼

1161
01:37:37,720 --> 01:37:39,760
已经火烧屁股了 明白我意思吗?
...fire under their asses, you understand me?

1162
01:37:39,795 --> 01:37:41,420
我要立刻拿到报告
We need those results now.

1163
01:37:41,430 --> 01:37:43,860
安娜你马上派人去 那个歌舞餐厅
Anna, you guys, you take the team... Anna! ...to the roadhouse.

1164
01:37:43,895 --> 01:37:46,560
我现在不管是谁打来的
Okay, I don't care who it is right now. I don't give...

1165
01:37:46,570 --> 01:37:49,830
安静!孟菲斯的电话
Guys! We got Memphis on the line.

1166
01:37:49,840 --> 01:37:51,160
马上跟踪
Start a trace.

1167
01:37:51,970 --> 01:37:53,660
没问题
Got it. I'm on it.

1168
01:37:53,670 --> 01:37:56,000
尼克 我是霍华德 你怎么样?
Nick. Hey, it's Howard here. How are you?

1169
01:37:56,170 --> 01:37:59,400
事情有点复杂了 我已经拘留史瓦格
Things have gotten a little complicated. I got Bob Lee Swagger in custody.

1170
01:38:00,410 --> 01:38:02,415
没错 霍华德 他确实没有死
Yeah, turns out he's not dead, Howard.

1171
01:38:02,450 --> 01:38:05,140
是的 我知道有那种可能
Yeah, I know. Word of that possibility had begun to reach us.

1172
01:38:05,780 --> 01:38:07,110
查到了
Got him.

1173
01:38:07,120 --> 01:38:08,815
你似乎在弗吉尼亚参加了枪战?
Were you in a gunfight in Virginia last night?

1174
01:38:08,850 --> 01:38:11,750
我说过了 事情变得有点复杂了
Like I said, things have gotten a little complicated.

1175
01:38:11,760 --> 01:38:16,230
当然 如果你要是能把他带回来 那就再好不过了
Well, obviously the best thing for you would be to bring him in, right?

1176
01:38:16,265 --> 01:38:18,230
不 我做不到
Oh, no. I can't do that.

1177
01:38:18,265 --> 01:38:19,320
为什么?
Why?

1178
01:38:19,330 --> 01:38:21,420
我不知道应该相信谁
It's gotten too deep. It's not clear who can be trusted.

1179
01:38:22,230 --> 01:38:24,700
- 我们可是 FBI - 是的 我知道
- But we're the FBI, son. - Yeah, I know.

1180
01:38:25,000 --> 01:38:26,230
我会保持联系
Yeah, I'll keep in touch.

1181
01:38:26,440 --> 01:38:27,630
尼克 等等!
Oh, Nick, wait...

1182
01:38:27,640 --> 01:38:29,605
该死的家伙!
Son of a bitch.

1183
01:38:29,640 --> 01:38:30,770
查到了? 嗯
- Did we get that? - Got him.

1184
01:38:30,780 --> 01:38:31,970
- 我们出发 - 他们在蒙大拿州
- Let's move. - They're on an interstate

1185
01:38:31,980 --> 01:38:34,310
- 波兹曼市郊的州际公路 - 快出发
- outside Bozeman, Montana. - Let's move!

1186
01:38:39,990 --> 01:38:41,015
我是史瓦格
This is Swagger.

1187
01:38:41,050 --> 01:38:42,850
- 我是约翰逊上校 - 我知道你在监听
- Colonel Johnson here. - Figured you'd be listening.

1188
01:38:42,885 --> 01:38:45,350
- 看来你走投无路了 - 上校?
- It appears you have nowhere to go. - Colonel?

1189
01:38:45,790 --> 01:38:46,860
如果你真是上校?
If it is "Colonel"?

1190
01:38:47,190 --> 01:38:48,420
我是
It is.

1191
01:38:49,830 --> 01:38:52,950
- 我这有你想要的东西 - 我也是
- I have something you want. - Well, it seems so do I.

1192
01:38:55,930 --> 01:39:00,800
就在厄立特里亚边境 一个大坑里埋了四百多具尸体
Over the Eritrean border, there is a mass grave with 400 bodies.

1193
01:39:00,810 --> 01:39:03,600
男人 女人 还有孩子
Men, women, children.

1194
01:39:04,680 --> 01:39:06,710
我可以拿它跟你作交换
Tell you what, I'll give it to you and we'll call it even.

1195
01:39:06,745 --> 01:39:08,280
但我需要一个可以信任的中间人
I just want someone there I can trust.

1196
01:39:08,315 --> 01:39:10,970
可以 你的人选是谁?
I'm amenable. Who do you have in mind?

1197
01:39:17,590 --> 01:39:21,020
我的朋友不同意
My colleague's questioning my choice. Okay,

1198
01:39:21,030 --> 01:39:24,620
我知道这太难为你了 那我就退一步
I see how that could be a tough problem. You know, last minute and all.

1199
01:39:25,500 --> 01:39:28,930
蒙大拿州第六届的参议员 查尔斯·米奇恩怎么样?
How about six-term senator Charles Meachum from Montana?

1200
01:39:28,965 --> 01:39:31,870
我认为这是个不错的第二选择
Seems like a pretty good second choice, don't you think?

1201
01:39:33,540 --> 01:39:34,900
我不这么想
I don't think so.

1202
01:39:34,910 --> 01:39:37,870
我先给你提供两个数字 然后我们再谈
I'm gonna provide you with two numbers, then we'll talk.

1203
01:39:37,880 --> 01:39:40,600
点 732 点 648
Point 732. Point 648.

1204
01:39:41,050 --> 01:39:42,340
你到底什么意思?
And what the hell is that?

1205
01:39:42,350 --> 01:39:45,610
他们是纬度和精度的后三位数字
Those are the last three digits, down to a few meters of latitude and longitude,

1206
01:39:45,620 --> 01:39:47,710
地点是厄立特里亚一个输油站
of an oil pipeline pumping station in Eritrea

1207
01:39:47,720 --> 01:39:49,150
下面埋有四百多具尸体
with 400 bodies underneath.

1208
01:39:49,750 --> 01:39:51,050
我们在哪见面?
Where are we meeting?

1209
01:39:52,620 --> 01:39:54,820
随便在哪都行
Somewhere I can see you,

1210
01:39:55,790 --> 01:39:58,660
但是要在离你足够远的地方
coming from a goddamn long way off.

1211
01:41:07,070 --> 01:41:08,500
你男朋友在哪?
Where's your boy?

1212
01:41:22,780 --> 01:41:24,510
好吧 我到了
Well, I'm here.

1213
01:41:33,220 --> 01:41:34,350
他来了
He's here.

1214
01:41:34,360 --> 01:41:35,760
看啊
Look, look, look.

1215
01:41:36,490 --> 01:41:38,620
那是你男友 宝贝
There's your boy. There's your boy, baby.

1216
01:41:47,210 --> 01:41:49,400
快看 快看
Come on, come on. Look, look. Look up.

1217
01:41:59,580 --> 01:42:00,980
完事了
Okay.

1218
01:42:44,430 --> 01:42:46,160
我好像断了一条肋骨
I think I broke a rib!

1219
01:42:47,700 --> 01:42:48,990
别动
Don't move!

1220
01:42:49,330 --> 01:42:50,870
还有其他狙击手吗?
Is there anybody else?

1221
01:42:51,370 --> 01:42:52,440
没了
No.

1222
01:43:19,260 --> 01:43:21,990
如果我被打中她也不会活着
He head-shoots me, spasm kills her!

1223
01:43:23,200 --> 01:43:25,290
不许开枪
You got no shot!

1224
01:43:25,300 --> 01:43:28,800
不许开枪 史瓦格你听到了没有?
No shot, Swagger! You hear that, Swagger?

1225
01:43:31,480 --> 01:43:33,270
不许开枪
You got no shot!

1226
01:43:33,810 --> 01:43:36,710
你想怎么样?
What are you gonna do? Come on!

1227
01:43:45,590 --> 01:43:47,350
你完蛋了 伙计
It's over for you, buddy!

1228
01:43:52,300 --> 01:43:55,030
不许开枪 干他
No shot! Okay, fuck him.

1229
01:44:08,950 --> 01:44:10,570
不赖嘛!
Not bad!

1230
01:44:10,580 --> 01:44:12,880
够水平 好枪法 有两下子
Pretty good! He went for the shot.

1231
01:44:15,220 --> 01:44:16,450
见鬼
Christ.

1232
01:44:34,210 --> 01:44:35,400
你有什么事?
How can we help you?

1233
01:44:35,410 --> 01:44:37,670
一位住客给我一百美元
Guest at the motel last night gave me $100

1234
01:44:37,680 --> 01:44:39,499
让我下午三点把这个送来
to bring this by here at 3:00 p.m.

1235
01:44:39,500 --> 01:44:40,650
寄信人:尼克·孟菲斯

1236
01:44:43,350 --> 01:44:44,440
行动!
Let's move!

1237
01:45:13,240 --> 01:45:14,330
你没事吧?
You all right?

1238
01:45:15,050 --> 01:45:16,110
没事
Yeah.

1239
01:45:26,390 --> 01:45:27,425
搜一下
Search him.

1240
01:45:27,460 --> 01:45:29,120
我没带武器
I don't carry a weapon,

1241
01:45:32,030 --> 01:45:33,360
今天例外
ordinarily.

1242
01:45:33,830 --> 01:45:36,060
我有本州的持枪许可证
I'm licensed to carry that in this state.

1243
01:45:43,980 --> 01:45:45,370
要飞行员下来
Pull the pilot.

1244
01:45:46,880 --> 01:45:49,070
快把武器放下!
Put your weapon down! Put it down!

1245
01:45:49,080 --> 01:45:50,340
把武器放下!
Put your gun down!

1246
01:45:50,350 --> 01:45:51,570
冷静 冷静
Easy. Easy.

1247
01:46:01,930 --> 01:46:03,080
莎拉
Sarah.

1248
01:46:04,030 --> 01:46:05,760
把枪给我
Give me the gun.

1249
01:46:06,360 --> 01:46:08,230
好了 把枪给我
It's okay. Give me the gun.

1250
01:46:17,480 --> 01:46:18,770
你没事吧?
You okay?

1251
01:46:18,840 --> 01:46:21,540
举起手来 把手举起来
Put them up. Keep them up.

1252
01:46:21,550 --> 01:46:23,200
好枪法 军士
Nice shooting, Gunnie.

1253
01:46:24,180 --> 01:46:26,880
你得到了你想要的东西
Yeah, you got what you came for.

1254
01:46:26,890 --> 01:46:29,250
现在给我我想要的
I think it's time you owe us your side of the bargain.

1255
01:46:29,285 --> 01:46:30,320
是吗?
You do, huh?

1256
01:46:30,360 --> 01:46:33,450
是的 当然是的
Yes, I do, son. I certainly do.

1257
01:46:34,030 --> 01:46:37,120
我们姑且把这事看成
Why don't we think about all this that has gone on

1258
01:46:37,130 --> 01:46:38,990
一个好的开始
just as a preamble?

1259
01:46:39,000 --> 01:46:40,960
你有什么打算?
You got any plans after this?

1260
01:46:41,530 --> 01:46:46,070
你的枪法很准 我很乐意为你提供一份工作
You have a rather unique skill set. I'd be interested in offering you a job.

1261
01:46:46,105 --> 01:46:48,335
为你工作?
Work? For you?

1262
01:46:48,370 --> 01:46:52,240
实际上没有你想的那么糟 我的目的不管怎样都会实现
It's not really as bad as it seems. It's all gonna be done in any case.

1263
01:46:52,275 --> 01:46:55,900
站在我一边你可以 得到一份可观的薪水
You might as well be on the side that gets you well paid for your efforts.

1264
01:46:55,910 --> 01:46:58,070
你是哪一边的?
And what side are you on?

1265
01:46:58,080 --> 01:47:01,050
其实无所谓那一边 没所谓逊尼还是什叶派
There are no sides. There's no Sunnis and Shiites.

1266
01:47:01,085 --> 01:47:02,310
没有民主党也没有共和党
There's no Democrats and Republicans.

1267
01:47:02,320 --> 01:47:04,685
有的只是穷人和富人
There's only haves and have-nots.

1268
01:47:04,720 --> 01:47:07,810
那我能为你干什么呢?参议员
What exactly does working for you entail, Senator?

1269
01:47:08,130 --> 01:47:11,420
强奸妇女?杀戮儿童? 你这变态
Raping and murdering innocent women and children, you sick fuck?

1270
01:47:11,430 --> 01:47:13,360
为了一条输油管线
You sanctioned the mass murder of an entire village

1271
01:47:13,395 --> 01:47:14,450
你居然能杀掉整个村的村民
so a pipeline could go through.

1272
01:47:14,470 --> 01:47:16,160
就一个村的!
One village!

1273
01:47:16,170 --> 01:47:18,290
但这给整个地区带来了安宁
And it brought stability to the region.

1274
01:47:18,300 --> 01:47:21,535
从此以后他们不会因为
Which means that no one chops off their arms

1275
01:47:21,570 --> 01:47:25,170
祖上属于不同的部落而进行仇杀
because their grandmother's grandfather belonged to a different tribe.

1276
01:47:26,080 --> 01:47:27,670
他们喜欢我们 年轻人
They like us down there, boy.

1277
01:47:34,620 --> 01:47:36,810
在我们国家
This is a country

1278
01:47:37,460 --> 01:47:39,750
就连国防部长…
where the Secretary of Defense

1279
01:47:41,830 --> 01:47:43,520
都能到电视上
can go on TV

1280
01:47:43,800 --> 01:47:46,020
对公众发表这样的演说词
and tell the American public,

1281
01:47:46,130 --> 01:47:49,860
"这是为了自由不是为了石油"
oh, that "This is about freedom! It's not about oil!"

1282
01:47:50,570 --> 01:47:52,565
没有人会质疑他
And nobody questions him,

1283
01:47:52,600 --> 01:47:55,570
因为没有人想揭穿他那十足的谎言
because they don't want to hear the answer because it's a lie!

1284
01:47:57,910 --> 01:48:02,240
进我的权力核心工作 没那么容易 军士
There's only so many places at the table, Gunnie.

1285
01:48:02,550 --> 01:48:04,310
你是想进来呢?
Now are you on the inside,

1286
01:48:04,550 --> 01:48:05,950
还是想留在外面?
or are you on the out?

1287
01:48:12,920 --> 01:48:14,360
是 FBI!
It's the FBI!

1288
01:48:15,090 --> 01:48:16,790
没关系 拿着
It's gonna be okay. Hold this.

1289
01:48:19,430 --> 01:48:22,900
如果其中有谁背叛了 财富积累的原则…
If one of them betrays the principles of the accrual...

1290
01:48:22,935 --> 01:48:24,660
你打错算盘了参议员
I don't think so, Senator.

1291
01:48:28,810 --> 01:48:30,840
你要干什么? 救你我的命
- What are you doing? - Saving our lives.

1292
01:48:31,180 --> 01:48:33,400
它能证明你是无辜的! 这里没有无辜的人
- That proved you were innocent! - Nobody out here is innocent!

1293
01:48:33,410 --> 01:48:37,315
这东西就像放射性物质 接触的人必死无疑
This stuff's plutonium. Nobody can handle it without dying.

1294
01:48:37,350 --> 01:48:40,910
一旦交给当局 它就会跟我们一起消失
You hand it over to the authorities, it's just gonna disappear, along with us!

1295
01:48:40,920 --> 01:48:44,010
你不想被埋在郊外吧 我也不想被抓
Unless you want to get buried in the hills outside Terlingua.

1296
01:48:44,020 --> 01:48:45,650
我不玩了 老鬼
I'm out, old man!

1297
01:48:45,660 --> 01:48:48,550
我是个粗人 我习惯了 在山顶过艰苦的日子
I'm just a peckerwood who lives in the hills with too many guns.

1298
01:48:48,560 --> 01:48:49,960
你满意了吗?
You happy?

1299
01:48:54,170 --> 01:48:56,030
你们去哪?
Where do you think you're going?

1300
01:48:56,065 --> 01:48:57,535
回华盛顿
Washington!

1301
01:48:57,570 --> 01:49:02,110
你想从背后杀死 一位在任的参议员?
You going to shoot a sitting U.S. Senator in the back?

1302
01:49:02,145 --> 01:49:03,760
老实说我很想
Lord knows I want to.

1303
01:49:04,540 --> 01:49:06,080
你不会这样做的
I didn't think so.

1304
01:49:07,250 --> 01:49:08,540
让他走
Let him go.

1305
01:49:09,480 --> 01:49:11,210
他们拿到了你的步枪
They've got your rifle.

1306
01:49:12,720 --> 01:49:15,250
他们一开始就拿到了你的步枪
From the beginning, they've always had your rifle.

1307
01:49:15,285 --> 01:49:17,010
就在谋杀的现场
Recovered at the site.

1308
01:49:24,260 --> 01:49:27,020
无论你怎样辩解
You can talk as much as you want, but in the end,

1309
01:49:30,000 --> 01:49:32,590
而我?该干嘛还是干嘛
and I'm going to go back to what I was doing.

1310
01:49:37,710 --> 01:49:38,930
我赢了
I won.

1311
01:49:39,880 --> 01:49:41,340
你输了
You lost.

1312
01:49:42,050 --> 01:49:44,310
听天由命吧 孩子
Get used to the idea, son.

1313
01:49:44,680 --> 01:49:46,220
我不是你的孩子
I'm not your son.

1314
01:50:00,770 --> 01:50:03,785
- 放下武器 !放下武器! - 别动
- Drop your weapons! Put it down now! - Don't move!

1315
01:50:03,820 --> 01:50:06,800
我是尼克·孟菲斯探员 我是 FBI 别开枪!
Special Agent Nick Memphis, FBI! Don't shoot!

1316
01:50:06,835 --> 01:50:09,070
- 趴下! - 趴在地上
- Down, now! - On the ground!

1317
01:50:09,570 --> 01:50:10,700
我说趴下!
I said get down!

1318
01:50:11,370 --> 01:50:13,190
司法部 华盛顿特区

1319
01:50:29,960 --> 01:50:32,690
- 可以给我解开吗? - 可以
- Could I free my hands, please? - It's okay.

1320
01:50:32,700 --> 01:50:34,420
谢谢
Thank you, sir.

1321
01:50:35,800 --> 01:50:37,560
谢谢把她带来
Thanks for bringing her.

1322
01:50:43,010 --> 01:50:45,705
我对这一切很抱歉
Hey. I'm sorry about everything.

1323
01:50:45,740 --> 01:50:48,140
不怪你 事情就是这个样子的
It's not your fault. It is what it is.

1324
01:50:51,780 --> 01:50:54,510
这位是司法部长罗瑟
This is Attorney General Russert.

1325
01:50:55,420 --> 01:50:58,110
- 局长布兰特 - 长官
- Director Brandt. - Sir.

1326
01:50:58,120 --> 01:51:00,550
米奇恩议员今天不能到场
Senator Meachum couldn't be with us today.

1327
01:51:00,560 --> 01:51:02,820
没有他我们一样可以开会
I'm sure we can manage without him.

1328
01:51:02,830 --> 01:51:05,160
史瓦格军士 这次会议是你要求的
Sergeant Swagger, you asked for this meeting.

1329
01:51:06,130 --> 01:51:09,460
尽管我不情愿 但看在 FBI 的面子上我还是同意了
Against my better judgment, I've agreed to it as a favor to the FBI.

1330
01:51:09,470 --> 01:51:11,030
这里有我什么事?
What the hell am I doing here?

1331
01:51:11,170 --> 01:51:13,360
我和本案毫无牵连 我是清白的
You've got nothing on me. I'm covered.

1332
01:51:16,770 --> 01:51:18,170
没必要上校
That won't be necessary, Colonel,

1333
01:51:18,180 --> 01:51:20,640
我至少接到了十几个电话
as I have already received no less than a dozen calls

1334
01:51:20,650 --> 01:51:24,800
高官都要求我能够放你一马
from highly-ranked and powerfully-placed individuals

1335
01:51:28,850 --> 01:51:32,750
以法律的名义叫他们滚蛋
and am, indeed, required by law, to tell them to fuck off.

1336
01:51:32,760 --> 01:51:34,520
这次会议是为了查明真相
This is about evidence and finding out the truth,

1337
01:51:34,530 --> 01:51:36,560
所以你最好坐着别乱开口
so you sit there and be quiet.

1338
01:51:40,100 --> 01:51:42,190
军士 给你五分钟的时间
Sergeant, you've got five minutes.

1339
01:51:42,200 --> 01:51:43,430
谢谢
Thank you.

1340
01:51:45,540 --> 01:51:47,335
这是我的步枪
This is my weapon.

1341
01:51:47,370 --> 01:51:49,800
毫无疑问 我不否认
No question about it, don't deny it.

1342
01:51:49,810 --> 01:51:52,270
你们很快就在现场找到了它
You recovered it at the scene moments after the assassination.

1343
01:51:52,280 --> 01:51:53,340
没异议
We agree?

1344
01:51:53,980 --> 01:51:55,600
此后一直由 FBI 保管
It's been in the FBI's possession ever since,

1345
01:51:55,610 --> 01:51:57,110
保证没有人动过?
hasn't been tampered with in any way?

1346
01:51:57,145 --> 01:51:58,740
没有 绝对没有
No. Absolutely not.

1347
01:51:58,750 --> 01:52:00,980
- 你用它射击过吗? - 没必要
- You fire the weapon? - There was no point.

1348
01:52:00,990 --> 01:52:03,215
子弹已经损毁的无法辨认了
The slug was mangled beyond recognition.

1349
01:52:03,250 --> 01:52:06,260
但是经过材质鉴定完全吻合
It was, however, an exact metallurgical match.

1350
01:52:06,295 --> 01:52:08,720
没错 这绝对是我的子弹
Right. Definitely my bullets.

1351
01:52:09,760 --> 01:52:11,520
这绝对是我的步枪
Definitely my gun.

1352
01:52:11,530 --> 01:52:14,100
孟菲斯你相信是我开的枪吗?
Special Agent Memphis, you believe I shot that Archbishop?

1353
01:52:14,135 --> 01:52:15,720
不 我不相信
Nope. No, I don't.

1354
01:52:15,730 --> 01:52:18,360
- 你有什么证据吗? - 没有
- Have any proof of this fact? - No.

1355
01:52:18,370 --> 01:52:19,900
- 你相信我吗? - 是的
- Trust me? - Yep.

1356
01:52:19,935 --> 01:52:21,160
真的相信?
Really trust me?

1357
01:52:21,440 --> 01:52:22,510
真的
Yeah.

1358
01:52:23,470 --> 01:52:24,770
用性命担保
With your life?

1359
01:52:25,280 --> 01:52:26,780
- 是的 - 那好
- Yep. - Good.

1360
01:52:28,250 --> 01:52:30,710
- 你想干什么? - 把枪放下
- What the hell are you doing? - Put that weapon down now!

1361
01:52:30,720 --> 01:52:33,650
如果这么近距离射击 枪口要再低一些
If you're zeroed for 600, you ought to aim a little lower.

1362
01:52:33,685 --> 01:52:35,240
这么近 没有必要
Ain't gonna make a difference this close.

1363
01:52:35,250 --> 01:52:38,110
关键要看我是不是疯了
Only thing that's gonna make a difference is whether I'm crazy or not.

1364
01:52:44,430 --> 01:52:46,290
我可以整天这么摆弄
I could keep doing this all day,

1365
01:52:46,930 --> 01:52:48,620
用家里所有的武器
with every weapon in my house.

1366
01:52:49,030 --> 01:52:52,190
在我出门的时候我总是把所有的撞针都换掉
I swapped all the firing pins before I left the house. I always do.

1367
01:52:52,200 --> 01:52:54,330
很难察觉 除非用千分尺来测量
Looks right, need a micrometer to tell.

1368
01:52:54,710 --> 01:52:56,170
但决不可能发射
But the gun don't shoot.

1369
01:52:56,470 --> 01:52:58,570
大主教身上的子弹 的确出自我的步枪
That bullet you got out of that bishop was fired from my weapon,

1370
01:52:58,580 --> 01:53:00,405
那是一周前打铁罐用的
but a week before, at a can of stew.

1371
01:53:00,440 --> 01:53:03,780
我发过誓要忠于祖国 抵抗国内外敌人侵害
I did take an oath to defend this country from all enemies, foreign and domestic.

1372
01:53:03,815 --> 01:53:06,180
但没想到有人要陷害我
I just didn't figure I'd end up quite this involved.

1373
01:53:06,215 --> 01:53:08,015
当尘埃落定之后
But at the end of the day, when all the dust settles,

1374
01:53:08,050 --> 01:53:10,710
你不要以为真相可以 轻易掩盖 混蛋
you can't hide from the truth, you son of a bitch.

1375
01:53:11,920 --> 01:53:13,150
随你的便
Whatever.

1376
01:53:13,820 --> 01:53:15,390
谁会相信?
Who gives a shit?

1377
01:53:16,630 --> 01:53:18,190
你表演的不错
Nice presentation.

1378
01:53:18,200 --> 01:53:20,090
可跟我毫无关系
But none of it sticks to me.

1379
01:53:21,200 --> 01:53:24,500
先生们 会议结束了
Gentlemen, this meeting is over.

1380
01:53:24,535 --> 01:53:25,860
结束了
Done.

1381
01:53:25,870 --> 01:53:27,300
后会有期
I'll be seeing you.

1382
01:53:27,310 --> 01:53:30,600
他说得对 没有证据说明他犯了罪
He's right. There's nothing to prove he did anything.

1383
01:53:30,610 --> 01:53:31,900
在国内没有
Yeah, in this country.

1384
01:53:31,910 --> 01:53:34,640
先生你应该看看这个
Sir, you should take a look at these.

1385
01:53:39,950 --> 01:53:45,510
这些图象来自与一份绝密文件 能证明在非洲的一个村子的
These images are from a classified file showing a village of people in Africa

1386
01:53:45,520 --> 01:53:48,320
全部村民被上校和他的同伙杀掉
that were exterminated by the colonel and his associates.

1387
01:53:48,330 --> 01:53:49,390
上帝啊
My God.

1388
01:53:49,490 --> 01:53:50,790
请不要忘记
Look around you.

1389
01:53:51,260 --> 01:53:53,490
这里不是非洲之角
This isn't the Horn of Africa.

1390
01:53:53,500 --> 01:53:55,160
那只是些传闻
That's all hearsay.

1391
01:53:55,170 --> 01:53:57,890
这里是自由之地 勇敢者的家园
This is the land of the free and the home of the brave.

1392
01:53:57,900 --> 01:53:59,440
我有离开的自由
And I'm free to go.

1393
01:53:59,970 --> 01:54:01,835
上校 你的道德观完全变态了
Colonel, your moral compass is so fucked up,

1394
01:54:01,870 --> 01:54:05,910
我怀疑你是否还能 面不改色心不跳地回到停车场
I'll be shocked if you manage to find your way back to the parking lot.

1395
01:54:05,945 --> 01:54:08,140
不管我对这些事情有怎样的看法
Regardless of how I feel about this,

1396
01:54:09,080 --> 01:54:10,670
它都是发生在别的国家
these events occurred in another country,

1397
01:54:10,680 --> 01:54:12,045
不是我国境内
outside of our laws.

1398
01:54:12,080 --> 01:54:14,710
原来是这样?就没有别的办法吗?
So that's it? That's the best you can do?

1399
01:54:14,720 --> 01:54:16,840
这里不是国际法庭 军士
This isn't the World Court, Sergeant.

1400
01:54:17,620 --> 01:54:19,985
我无权扣留上校
And I don't have the jurisdiction to detain the colonel

1401
01:54:20,020 --> 01:54:22,755
不管他是否真的在国外 犯下了那些罪行
for crimes he may or may not have committed on another continent.

1402
01:54:22,790 --> 01:54:26,420
- 先生 我恳请你重新考虑下 - 没什么可考虑的
- Sir, I urge you to reconsider... - There's nothing to reconsider, son.

1403
01:54:29,800 --> 01:54:31,530
我赢了
I win.

1404
01:54:31,540 --> 01:54:32,860
而你这次
You lose.

1405
01:54:33,500 --> 01:54:34,570
又输了
Again.

1406
01:54:36,840 --> 01:54:38,500
简直太荒唐了
This is ridiculous.

1407
01:55:00,700 --> 01:55:04,360
说实话我比你更不喜欢这个结果
For the record, I don't like the way this turned out any more than you do.

1408
01:55:04,970 --> 01:55:07,490
但这就是我们生活的世界
But this is the world we live in.

1409
01:55:07,525 --> 01:55:10,010
法律也不是万能的
And justice does not always prevail.

1410
01:55:10,045 --> 01:55:11,070
这不是早期的西部
It's not the Wild West,

1411
01:55:11,080 --> 01:55:13,470
不能用枪解决所有问题
where you can clean up the streets with a gun.

1412
01:55:14,710 --> 01:55:17,650
尽管有时你必须那样做
Even though sometimes that's exactly what's needed.

1413
01:55:22,190 --> 01:55:24,820
鲍·李·史瓦格 你自由了
Bob Lee Swagger, you're free to go.

1414
01:55:28,860 --> 01:55:30,760
给他打开脚镣
Unshackle the sergeant.

1415
01:55:34,000 --> 01:55:36,330
我们打出了一记重拳 参议员
I'd say that's quite a shot, Senator.

1416
01:55:36,365 --> 01:55:37,700
正中目标
In the face.

1417
01:55:39,000 --> 01:55:41,330
有句话说得好
You heard that expression,

1418
01:55:41,340 --> 01:55:43,740
"打掉牙齿只能往肚里吞"
"You didn't know whether to shit or go blind"?

1419
01:55:47,610 --> 01:55:50,940
你真该看看司法部长脸上的表情
You should've seen the look on the Attorney General's face.

1420
01:55:51,950 --> 01:55:56,350
他是不是又谈 "权力至上"的老调了?
Did he give his checks-and-balances speech?

1421
01:55:56,385 --> 01:55:59,850
"这是为了举证和查明真相"
"This is about evidence and the truth!"

1422
01:55:59,860 --> 01:56:02,480
你应该直接了当的对他说
And then you just said to him,

1423
01:56:02,490 --> 01:56:03,890
"见你的鬼"
"Fuck you!"

1424
01:56:04,860 --> 01:56:07,360
"一边呆着去 部长先生"
"Hold my cigar, Mr. A.G."

1425
01:56:09,530 --> 01:56:10,930
见你的鬼
"Fuck you!

142
